(12, 'Repair and Troubleshooting of Computers', '<div>This lesson introduces learners to the principles and practices of troubleshooting common computer problems affecting both hardware and software systems through a structured approach in identifying issues, analyzing root causes, and applying effective solutions to restore system functionality.</div><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Learning Objectives:</strong></p><p>This lesson aims to:</p><ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><li>identify common computer hardware problems and their indicators; </li><li>analyze and diagnose the root causes of hardware issues using a systematic troubleshooting approach; and</li><li>apply appropriate step-by-step troubleshooting procedures to resolve hardware issues safely and effectively.</li></ol>', 5, '', 0, 0, 'English', 0, '2026-04-05 15:34:35', '2026-06-14 08:07:33', '[{\"id\":1776122966270,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":1,\"title\":\"Topic 1: What is Troubleshooting?\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1777220247043,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":2,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Troubleshooting is a systematic process used to identify, analyze, and resolve problems within a computer system. It involves observing symptoms, isolating possible causes, and applying solutions to restore normal operation.[1]</p>\\n<p>Troubleshooting is essential in Computer Hardware Servicing (CHS) because it allows technicians to efficiently diagnose and fix issues affecting computer performance. Without proper troubleshooting, problems may escalate, causing hardware damage, data loss, or system failure.[2]</p>\\n<p>During this lesson, we will tackle multiple issues commonly encountered with both the computer’s hardware and software. We will learn what are the indicators of these issues happening, what causes them, and what is the procedure we can do to troubleshoot and fix them. Familiarity with the devices will be needed, but rest assured that since you’ve passed the previous lessons, you already have quite a grasp of the fundamentals of CHS and how we will apply it in troubleshooting.</p>\\n<p>What process is used to identify and fix computer problems step-by-step?</p>\\n<p>a. Formatting</p>\\n<p>b. Troubleshooting</p>\\n<p>c. Installing</p>\\n<p>d. Upgrading</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableTitle\":\"\",\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122966460,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"video\",\"order\":3,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Lesson 5 Topic 1 Video\",\"content\":\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/sxgs0i2zficmcqeah3951/Lesson-5-Topic-1.mp4?rlkey=dpaqqy1kfpjmemlx38nldnugs&st=b2cqmdog&dl=0\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122966273,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":4,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122966272,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Formatting\",\"Troubleshooting\",\"Installing\",\"Upgrading\"],\"question\":\"What process is used to identify and fix computer problems step-by-step?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]},{\"id\":1776122966274,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":5,\"title\":\"Topic 2: Hardware Issues\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1777220247044,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":6,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<div><p>Hardware&nbsp;refers&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;physical&nbsp;components&nbsp;of&nbsp;a&nbsp;computer&nbsp;system&nbsp;that&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;seen&nbsp;and&nbsp;touched,&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;the&nbsp;motherboard,&nbsp;processor,&nbsp;RAM,&nbsp;storage&nbsp;devices,&nbsp;and&nbsp;peripherals.[3]</p>\\n<p>Hardware&nbsp;issues&nbsp;are&nbsp;common&nbsp;because&nbsp;physical&nbsp;components&nbsp;are&nbsp;constantly&nbsp;exposed&nbsp;to&nbsp;environmental&nbsp;and&nbsp;usage-related&nbsp;stress.&nbsp;Over&nbsp;time,&nbsp;heat,&nbsp;dust,&nbsp;and&nbsp;electrical&nbsp;fluctuations&nbsp;weaken&nbsp;these&nbsp;components.&nbsp;For&nbsp;example,&nbsp;a&nbsp;dust-filled&nbsp;cooling&nbsp;fan&nbsp;can&nbsp;no&nbsp;longer&nbsp;regulate&nbsp;temperature&nbsp;properly,&nbsp;leading&nbsp;to&nbsp;overheating&nbsp;and&nbsp;system&nbsp;failure.&nbsp;While&nbsp;there&nbsp;are&nbsp;lots&nbsp;of&nbsp;possible&nbsp;reasons&nbsp;for&nbsp;hardware&nbsp;issues&nbsp;to&nbsp;happen,&nbsp;we&nbsp;can&nbsp;generally&nbsp;consolidate&nbsp;them&nbsp;into&nbsp;the&nbsp;</p><div>\\n<p>Troubleshooting is a systematic process used to identify, analyze, and resolve problems within a computer system. It involves observing symptoms, isolating possible causes, and applying solutions to restore normal operation.[1]</p><p>Troubleshooting is essential in Computer Hardware Servicing (CHS) because it allows technicians to efficiently diagnose and fix issues affecting computer performance. Without proper troubleshooting, problems may escalate, causing hardware damage, data loss, or system failure.[2]</p><p>During this lesson, we will ta</p>\\n</div><div>\\n\\n<p>Troubleshooting is a systematic process used to identify, analyze, and resolve problems within a computer system. It involves observing symptoms, isolating possible causes, and applying solutions to restore normal operation.[1]</p><p>Troubleshooting is essential in Computer Hardware Servicing (CHS) because it allows technicians to efficiently diagnose and fix issues affecting computer performance. Without proper troubleshooting, problems may escalate, causing hardware damage, data loss, or system failure.[2]</p><p>During this lesson, we will ta</p>\\n</div><div>\\n\\n<p>Troubleshooting is a systematic process used to identify, analyze, and resolve problems within a computer system. It involves observing symptoms, isolating possible causes, and applying solutions to restore normal operation.[1]</p><p>Troubleshooting is essential in Computer Hardware Servicing (CHS) because it allows technicians to efficiently diagnose and fix issues affecting computer performance. Without proper troubleshooting, problems may escalate, causing hardware damage, data loss, or system failure.[2]</p><p>During this lesson, we will ta</p>\\n</div><p>following&nbsp;reasons:</p>\\n<p>Wear&nbsp;and&nbsp;Tear –&nbsp;components&nbsp;degrade&nbsp;over&nbsp;time&nbsp;due&nbsp;to&nbsp;continuous&nbsp;use,&nbsp;eventually&nbsp;leading&nbsp;to&nbsp;failure&nbsp;or&nbsp;reduced&nbsp;performance.</p>\\n<p>Overheating –&nbsp;excessive&nbsp;heat&nbsp;caused&nbsp;by&nbsp;poor&nbsp;ventilation&nbsp;or&nbsp;dust&nbsp;buildup&nbsp;can&nbsp;damage&nbsp;internal&nbsp;parts&nbsp;and&nbsp;shorten&nbsp;their&nbsp;lifespan.</p>\\n<p>Power&nbsp;Surges –&nbsp;sudden&nbsp;spikes&nbsp;in&nbsp;electricity&nbsp;can&nbsp;damage&nbsp;sensitive&nbsp;electronic&nbsp;components.</p>\\n<p>Improper&nbsp;Handling –&nbsp;physical&nbsp;damage&nbsp;from&nbsp;dropping&nbsp;or&nbsp;incorrectly&nbsp;installing&nbsp;components&nbsp;can&nbsp;cause&nbsp;malfunction.</p>\\n<p>Manufacturing&nbsp;Defects –&nbsp;some&nbsp;hardware&nbsp;may&nbsp;fail&nbsp;early&nbsp;due&nbsp;to&nbsp;production&nbsp;faults.</p>\\n<p>In&nbsp;CHS,&nbsp;resolving&nbsp;hardware&nbsp;issues&nbsp;involves&nbsp;applying&nbsp;technical&nbsp;knowledge,&nbsp;diagnostic&nbsp;tools,&nbsp;and&nbsp;proper&nbsp;procedures&nbsp;to&nbsp;identify&nbsp;and&nbsp;repair&nbsp;faulty&nbsp;components.&nbsp;It&nbsp;includes&nbsp;inspecting&nbsp;connections,&nbsp;testing&nbsp;parts,&nbsp;replacing&nbsp;defective&nbsp;hardware,&nbsp;and&nbsp;ensuring&nbsp;compatibility.[4]</p></div>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableTitle\":\"\",\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122966277,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":7,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122966276,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Software corruption\",\"Physical wear and tear of components\",\"Internet failure\",\"Driver problem\"],\"question\":\"Why are hardware issues common in computers?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]},{\"id\":1776122966278,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":8,\"title\":\"Topic 3: Common Hardware Issues\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1777220247045,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":9,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>a. Computer Does Not Turn On / Boot</p>\\n<p>Before anything appears on the screen, a computer must first receive and distribute power to its internal components, which starts the moment you press the ‘on’ button of your computer. In case the system fails to perform power delivery during this process, it cannot begin the startup process. A failure to power on is often a symptom of deeper electrical issues within the system. If caused by a faulty PSU, unstable or incorrect voltage may have already affected sensitive components such as the motherboard, CPU, or storage devices. Repeated attempts to power on with unresolved electrical issues can increase the risk of short circuits or further damage to internal components. Over time, unresolved power delivery problems may lead to permanent hardware failure, making recovery more difficult and costly.[4][2]</p>\\n<p>To properly identify this issue, it is important to observe the visible system’s behavior when attempting to power it on. The following signs help confirm whether the problem is related to power delivery or startup failure:</p>\\n<p>No lights or indicators – shows that no electrical power is reaching or being distributed in the system.[5]</p>\\n<p>No fan movement – indicates that internal components are not receiving power to operate.</p>\\n<p>No sound or response – confirms that the system is not initiating the boot process at all.</p>\\n<p>Once these symptoms are identified, the next step is to understand what could be causing the issue. These possible reasons are all related to failures in the system’s power flow, either externally or internally, and so must be checked to resolve the issue:</p>\\n<p>Faulty Power Supply Unit (PSU) – As discussed in Lesson 3, the power supply is the main source of power conversion inside the system. In cases when a computer fails to get power, the power supply could possibly be preventing the conversion of electricity into usable power for the system.[4]</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableTitle\":\"\",\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1777220247046,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":10,\"title\":\"Common Hardware Issues\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/194_remove_and_reconnect_them_if_necessary_4.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Remove and reconnect them if necessary\",\"fileName\":null},{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/195_once_measurements_are_complete_disconnec.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Once measurements are complete\",\"fileName\":null}],\"layout\":\"side-by-side\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/194_remove_and_reconnect_them_if_necessary_4.webp\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122966376,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":11,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122966367,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Storage issue\",\"Display or graphics issue\",\"Keyboard issue\",\"Network issue\"],\"question\":\"What does it indicate when a computer turns on but has no display?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966368,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Check operating system\",\"Check monitor and cable connections\",\"Check keyboard\",\"Check BIOS battery\"],\"question\":\"What is the first step when troubleshooting a no display issue?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966369,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Monitor issue\",\"Power or overheating problem\",\"Keyboard issue\",\"Printer issue\"],\"question\":\"Why does a computer restart randomly?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966370,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"It improves speed\",\"It can damage internal components\",\"It fixes software\",\"It improves display\"],\"question\":\"Why should overheating be addressed immediately?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966371,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Software crash\",\"Overheating\",\"Display issue\",\"Network issue\"],\"question\":\"What issue is indicated by loud fan noise and high temperature?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966372,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"GPU\",\"Drive connection or failure\",\"Mouse\",\"Monitor\"],\"question\":\"What does it mean when a hard drive is not detected?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966373,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Replace keyboard\",\"System issue on original computer\",\"Replace monitor\",\"Replace GPU\"],\"question\":\"Why test a peripheral on another computer?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966374,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Replace device\",\"Check connections and ports\",\"Replace motherboard\",\"Format system\"],\"question\":\"What should be done if a peripheral is not recognized?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966375,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Replace motherboard\",\"Check connection and port\",\"Format system\",\"Replace PSU\"],\"question\":\"What is the first step when troubleshooting a peripheral that is not working?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]},{\"id\":1776122966377,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":12,\"title\":\"Topic 4: Software Issues\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1777220247047,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":13,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Software is the set of instructions or programs that tell a computer what to do. It is separate from hardware, which refers to the physical components of the computer, and it includes the operating system, applications, utilities, and other digital tools that make the system functional and programmable. Without software, the hardware would not know how to perform tasks, display information, or respond to user input. [22]</p>\\n<p>Problems that affect the programs, operating system functions, and digital instructions that allow the computer to work properly can be classified as software issues. Unlike hardware issues, these problems do not usually involve broken physical parts at first; instead, they often involve corrupted files, failed updates, incorrect settings, driver problems, malware, or applications that do not behave as expected. Because software controls how hardware is used, software issues can still cause serious effects on performance, stability, and usability even when the physical components are still working. [22][23][24]</p>\\n<p>Software issues commonly happen because of the following:</p>\\n<p>Frequent updates and changes – operating systems, apps, and drivers are updated regularly, and incomplete or failed updates can cause problems. [23][24]</p>\\n<p>Incorrect settings or misconfiguration – software may stop working properly if the wrong device, option, or system setting is selected. [23][25]</p>\\n<p>Corrupted system or application files – damaged files can prevent Windows features or apps from working as intended. [23][25]</p>\\n<p>Too many background processes or startup apps – these can slow the system down or cause instability over time. [24]</p>\\n<p>Malware or unwanted software – harmful or unwanted programs can affect performance, security, and normal system behavior. [24]</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableTitle\":\"\",\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122966382,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":14,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122966381,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Hardware damage\",\"Software conflicts and misconfiguration\",\"Loose cables\",\"Power failure\"],\"question\":\"Why are software issues common?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]},{\"id\":1776122966383,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":15,\"title\":\"Topic 5: Common Software Issues\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1777220247048,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":16,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>a. Operating System Not Booting</p>\\n<p>When the operating system does not boot, the computer may power on but fail before reaching the desktop. In many cases, the machine gets stuck on a manufacturer logo, shows an automatic repair loop, or displays recovery-related messages instead of loading Windows normally. This usually means that Windows startup files, boot configuration data, update state, or disk-related system files are damaged, incomplete, or inaccessible. [11][13][21]</p>\\n<p>Before listing specific causes, it is important to recognize what “not booting” looks like in practice. The system may still receive power and may even pass the basic hardware startup phase, but Windows itself does not complete loading. These symptoms help distinguish an operating system boot issue from a total hardware power failure. [11][21]</p>\\n<p>Stuck on the manufacturer logo or spinning dots for an unusually long time – Windows has begun startup but cannot continue normally. [11][21]</p>\\n<p>Automatic Repair or recovery screens appear repeatedly – Windows detects a startup problem and keeps redirecting to recovery tools instead of completing boot. [11]</p>\\n<p>Error messages related to boot files or startup repair appear – the boot configuration, startup files, or recovery path may be damaged. [11][21]</p>\\n<p>A recent failed update or sudden shutdown happened before the problem started – incomplete updates or abrupt shutdowns can leave startup files in an inconsistent state. [13][21]</p>\\n<p>A Windows system may fail to boot for several reasons, and many of them affect startup-critical files or settings. Understanding these reasons helps guide troubleshooting in the right order. [11][13][21]</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableTitle\":\"\",\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122966459,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":17,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122966455,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Display issue\",\"Peripheral issue\",\"Operating system boot failure\",\"Cooling issue\"],\"question\":\"What issue is indicated when a computer turns on but does not boot into the operating system?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122966456,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Overheating\",\"Boot failure\",\"Slow computer performance\",\"Display issue\"],\"question\":\"What issue is indicated when a computer takes a long time to open programs and respond to commands?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122966457,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Driver failure\",\"Overheating\",\"File corruption\",\"No display\"],\"question\":\"What issue occurs when files cannot be opened or display unexpected errors?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122966458,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"RAM\",\"CMOS battery\",\"GPU\",\"Hard drive\"],\"question\":\"What should be replaced if BIOS time resets?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]}]', '[{\"id\":1776122966272,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Formatting\",\"Troubleshooting\",\"Installing\",\"Upgrading\"],\"question\":\"What process is used to identify and fix computer problems step-by-step?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966276,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Software corruption\",\"Physical wear and tear of components\",\"Internet failure\",\"Driver problem\"],\"question\":\"Why are hardware issues common in computers?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966367,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Storage issue\",\"Display or graphics issue\",\"Keyboard issue\",\"Network issue\"],\"question\":\"What does it indicate when a computer turns on but has no display?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966368,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Check operating system\",\"Check monitor and cable connections\",\"Check keyboard\",\"Check BIOS battery\"],\"question\":\"What is the first step when troubleshooting a no display issue?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966369,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Monitor issue\",\"Power or overheating problem\",\"Keyboard issue\",\"Printer issue\"],\"question\":\"Why does a computer restart randomly?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]', '[{\"id\":1776122966635,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Formatting\",\"Troubleshooting\",\"Installing\",\"Upgrading\"],\"question\":\"What process is used to identify and fix computer problems step-by-step?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966636,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Software corruption\",\"Physical wear and tear of components\",\"Internet failure\",\"Driver problem\"],\"question\":\"Why are hardware issues common in computers?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966637,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Storage issue\",\"Display or graphics issue\",\"Keyboard issue\",\"Network issue\"],\"question\":\"What does it indicate when a computer turns on but has no display?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966638,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Check operating system\",\"Check monitor and cable connections\",\"Check keyboard\",\"Check BIOS battery\"],\"question\":\"What is the first step when troubleshooting a no display issue?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966639,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Monitor issue\",\"Power or overheating problem\",\"Keyboard issue\",\"Printer issue\"],\"question\":\"Why does a computer restart randomly?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966640,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"It improves speed\",\"It can damage internal components\",\"It fixes software\",\"It improves display\"],\"question\":\"Why should overheating be addressed immediately?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966641,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Software crash\",\"Overheating\",\"Display issue\",\"Network issue\"],\"question\":\"What issue is indicated by loud fan noise and high temperature?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966642,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"GPU\",\"Drive connection or failure\",\"Mouse\",\"Monitor\"],\"question\":\"What does it mean when a hard drive is not detected?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966643,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Replace keyboard\",\"System issue on original computer\",\"Replace monitor\",\"Replace GPU\"],\"question\":\"Why test a peripheral on another computer?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966644,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Replace device\",\"Check connections and ports\",\"Replace motherboard\",\"Format system\"],\"question\":\"What should be done if a peripheral is not recognized?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966645,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Replace motherboard\",\"Check connection and port\",\"Format system\",\"Replace PSU\"],\"question\":\"What is the first step when troubleshooting a peripheral that is not working?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966646,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Hardware damage\",\"Software conflicts and misconfiguration\",\"Loose cables\",\"Power failure\"],\"question\":\"Why are software issues common?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966647,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Display issue\",\"Peripheral issue\",\"Operating system boot failure\",\"Cooling issue\"],\"question\":\"What issue is indicated when a computer turns on but does not boot into the operating system?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122966648,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Overheating\",\"Boot failure\",\"Slow computer performance\",\"Display issue\"],\"question\":\"What issue is indicated when a computer takes a long time to open programs and respond to commands?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122966649,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Driver failure\",\"Overheating\",\"File corruption\",\"No display\"],\"question\":\"What issue occurs when files cannot be opened or display unexpected errors?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122966650,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"RAM\",\"CMOS battery\",\"GPU\",\"Hard drive\"],\"question\":\"What should be replaced if BIOS time resets?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966651,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Software issue\",\"Hardware issue\",\"Network issue\",\"Operating system issue\"],\"question\":\"When a computer experiences problems caused by physical components like RAM, hard drive, or motherboard, what type of issue is this?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966652,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Monitor cable\",\"Power source and power connections\",\"Operating system\",\"Keyboard\"],\"question\":\"What should be checked first when a computer does not power on?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966653,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Hardware issue\",\"Software issue\",\"Electrical issue\",\"Cooling issue\"],\"question\":\"It is the problems that affect the digital instructions, programs, and operating system functions that allow the computer to work properly.\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966654,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Replace motherboard\",\"Running programs and system resource usage\",\"Replace monitor\",\"Replace PSU\"],\"question\":\"What should be checked first when a computer frequently freezes?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]', '[{\"id\":1776122966655,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Device not recognized\",\"Operating system not booting\",\"Slow computer\",\"File corruption\"],\"question\":\"Question: A computer powers on, but instead of loading the desktop, it repeatedly restarts and returns to the recovery screen. What issue is being described?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966656,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"It replaces hardware\",\"It attempts to repair boot configuration and system files\",\"It updates drivers\",\"It resets BIOS\"],\"question\":\"Question: A computer cannot reach the desktop and displays recovery options. Why should Startup Repair be attempted first?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966657,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Device not recognized\",\"Slow computer performance\",\"Incorrect BIOS time\",\"Blue screen error\"],\"question\":\"Question: A computer performs normally at startup but becomes very slow when multiple programs are opened simultaneously. What issue is being described?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966658,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"To improve display\",\"To reduce unnecessary programs using system resources\",\"To reset BIOS\",\"To fix file corruption\"],\"question\":\"Question: A computer becomes slow immediately after logging in because many applications load automatically. Why should startup programs be reviewed?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966659,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Replace motherboard\",\"Check system resource usage in Task Manager\",\"Replace power supply\",\"Reset BIOS\"],\"question\":\"Question: The system becomes unresponsive while several programs are open. What should be checked first?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966660,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Slow computer\",\"Applications crashing\",\"Device not recognized\",\"No display\"],\"question\":\"Question: A program closes unexpectedly without warning while working. What issue is being described?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966661,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"To reset BIOS\",\"To resolve compatibility and stability issues\",\"To fix hardware\",\"To clean disk\"],\"question\":\"Multiple applications close unexpectedly. Why should updates be checked?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966662,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Device not recognized\",\"File corruption\",\"Slow computer\",\"Overheating\"],\"question\":\"Question: After a sudden power interruption, documents show errors and cannot be opened. What issue is being described?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966663,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"To reset BIOS\",\"To detect and repair file system errors\",\"To update drivers\",\"To improve cooling\"],\"question\":\"Question: Files display errors and cannot be opened. Why should disk checking be performed?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966664,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Replace RAM\",\"Run system file and disk integrity checks\",\"Replace PSU\",\"Reset BIOS\"],\"question\":\"Question: Files cannot be opened after improper shutdown. What should be done first?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966665,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Slow computer\",\"Blue Screen of Death\",\"Device not recognized\",\"File corruption\"],\"question\":\"Question: The computer suddenly displays a blue screen and restarts. What issue is being described?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966666,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"To reset BIOS\",\"To identify the cause of the system crash\",\"To replace hardware\",\"To format system\"],\"question\":\"Question: A blue screen displays a stop code. Why should the code be reviewed?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966667,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Slow computer\",\"Incorrect BIOS time\",\"File corruption\",\"Device not recognized\"],\"question\":\"Question: The computer clock resets to default every time it is turned off. What issue is being described?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966668,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"To Improve display\",\"To Restore stored BIOS configuration\",\"To Fix drivers\",\"To Improve cooling\"],\"question\":\"Question: BIOS time resets after shutdown. Why replace CMOS battery?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966669,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Replace motherboard\",\"Check Device Manager and reinstall drivers\",\"Replace PSU\",\"Reset BIOS\"],\"question\":\"Question: A USB device is connected but not detected. What should be checked first?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966685,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Formatting\",\"Troubleshooting\",\"Installing\",\"Upgrading\"],\"question\":\"Question: A technician follows a structured method to diagnose and solve a system issue. What is this process called?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966686,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Software corruption\",\"Physical wear and tear of components\",\"Internet failure\",\"Driver problem\"],\"question\":\"Question: A computer begins failing after years of use due to worn components. What explains this?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966687,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Storage issue\",\"Display or graphics issue\",\"Keyboard issue\",\"Network issue\"],\"question\":\"Question: The CPU fans spin and lights turn on, but the screen remains blank. What issue is likely?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966688,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Check operating system\",\"Check monitor and cable connections\",\"Check keyboard\",\"Check BIOS battery\"],\"question\":\"Question: A computer is running but the monitor shows nothing. What should be checked first?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966689,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Monitor issue\",\"Power or overheating problem\",\"Keyboard issue\",\"Printer issue\"],\"question\":\"Question: A computer restarts during heavy tasks. What is likely causing this?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966690,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"It improves speed\",\"It can damage internal components\",\"It fixes software\",\"It improves display\"],\"question\":\"Question: A computer frequently shuts down due to high temperature. Why must this be fixed?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966691,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Software crash\",\"Overheating\",\"Display issue\",\"Network issue\"],\"question\":\"Question: A computer fan runs loudly and the system becomes hot. What issue is this?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966692,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"GPU\",\"Drive connection or failure\",\"Mouse\",\"Monitor\"],\"question\":\"Question: The system cannot find storage during boot. What should be checked?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966693,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Replace keyboard\",\"System issue on original computer\",\"Replace monitor\",\"Replace GPU\"],\"question\":\"Question: A keyboard does not work on one PC but works on another. What does this indicate?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966694,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Replace device\",\"Check connections and ports\",\"Replace motherboard\",\"Format system\"],\"question\":\"Question: A USB device is not detected. What is the first step?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966695,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Replace motherboard\",\"Check connection and port\",\"Format system\",\"Replace PSU\"],\"question\":\"Question: A mouse is not responding. What should be checked first?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966696,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Hardware damage\",\"Software conflicts and misconfiguration\",\"Loose cables\",\"Power failure\"],\"question\":\"Question: A computer malfunctions after installing incompatible applications. What explains this?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966697,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Display issue\",\"Peripheral issue\",\"Operating system boot failure\",\"Cooling issue\"],\"question\":\"Question: A computer powers on and shows the manufacturer logo but cannot proceed to the desktop. What issue is this?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122966698,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Overheating\",\"Boot failure\",\"Slow computer performance\",\"Display issue\"],\"question\":\"Question: A computer boots successfully, but opening applications takes several minutes and the system responds very slowly when multiple programs are running. What issue is being described?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122966699,\"type\":\"Situational\",\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Driver failure\",\"Overheating\",\"File corruption\",\"No display\"],\"question\":\"Question: A user attempts to open a document, but the file shows an error message and cannot be accessed. Other files also behave similarly after a sudden system shutdown. What issue is being described?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122966670,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Device not recognized\",\"Operating system not booting\",\"Slow computer\",\"File corruption\"],\"question\":\"Question: A computer powers on, but instead of loading the desktop, it repeatedly restarts and returns to the recovery screen. What issue is being described?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966671,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"It replaces hardware\",\"It attempts to repair boot configuration and system files\",\"It updates drivers\",\"It resets BIOS\"],\"question\":\"Question: A computer cannot reach the desktop and displays recovery options. Why should Startup Repair be attempted first?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966672,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Device not recognized\",\"Slow computer performance\",\"Incorrect BIOS time\",\"Blue screen error\"],\"question\":\"Question: A computer performs normally at startup but becomes very slow when multiple programs are opened simultaneously. What issue is being described?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966673,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"To improve display\",\"To reduce unnecessary programs using system resources\",\"To reset BIOS\",\"To fix file corruption\"],\"question\":\"Question: A computer becomes slow immediately after logging in because many applications load automatically. Why should startup programs be reviewed?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966674,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Replace motherboard\",\"Check system resource usage in Task Manager\",\"Replace power supply\",\"Reset BIOS\"],\"question\":\"Question: The system becomes unresponsive while several programs are open. What should be checked first?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966675,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Slow computer\",\"Applications crashing\",\"Device not recognized\",\"No display\"],\"question\":\"Question: A program closes unexpectedly without warning while working. What issue is being described?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966676,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"To reset BIOS\",\"To resolve compatibility and stability issues\",\"To fix hardware\",\"To clean disk\"],\"question\":\"Multiple applications close unexpectedly. Why should updates be checked?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966677,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Device not recognized\",\"File corruption\",\"Slow computer\",\"Overheating\"],\"question\":\"Question: After a sudden power interruption, documents show errors and cannot be opened. What issue is being described?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966678,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"To reset BIOS\",\"To detect and repair file system errors\",\"To update drivers\",\"To improve cooling\"],\"question\":\"Question: Files display errors and cannot be opened. Why should disk checking be performed?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966679,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Replace RAM\",\"Run system file and disk integrity checks\",\"Replace PSU\",\"Reset BIOS\"],\"question\":\"Question: Files cannot be opened after improper shutdown. What should be done first?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966680,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Slow computer\",\"Blue Screen of Death\",\"Device not recognized\",\"File corruption\"],\"question\":\"Question: The computer suddenly displays a blue screen and restarts. What issue is being described?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966681,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"To reset BIOS\",\"To identify the cause of the system crash\",\"To replace hardware\",\"To format system\"],\"question\":\"Question: A blue screen displays a stop code. Why should the code be reviewed?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966682,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Slow computer\",\"Incorrect BIOS time\",\"File corruption\",\"Device not recognized\"],\"question\":\"Question: The computer clock resets to default every time it is turned off. What issue is being described?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966683,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"To Improve display\",\"To Restore stored BIOS configuration\",\"To Fix drivers\",\"To Improve cooling\"],\"question\":\"Question: BIOS time resets after shutdown. Why replace CMOS battery?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122966684,\"type\":\"Easy\",\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Replace motherboard\",\"Check Device Manager and reinstall drivers\",\"Replace PSU\",\"Reset BIOS\"],\"question\":\"Question: A USB device is connected but not detected. What should be checked first?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]', '{\"hours\":0,\"minutes\":30}', 'Easy', NULL, '[{\"id\":\"introduction\",\"type\":\"introduction\",\"label\":\"Introduction\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":\"diagnostic\",\"type\":\"diagnostic\",\"label\":\"Diagnostic\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":\"lesson\",\"type\":\"lesson\",\"label\":\"Lesson\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":\"final\",\"type\":\"final\",\"label\":\"Final Assessment\",\"order\":4}]');
INSERT INTO `module` (`ModuleID`, `ModuleTitle`, `Description`, `LessonOrder`, `Tesda_Reference`, `Is_Unlocked`, `Is_Completed`, `LessonLanguage`, `Is_Deleted`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `sections`, `diagnosticQuestions`, `reviewQuestions`, `finalQuestions`, `LessonTime`, `Difficulty`, `finalInstruction`, `roadmapStages`) VALUES
(13, 'Maintenance and Documentation', '<div>This lesson focuses on the essential practices of maintaining computer systems, software, and hardware, as well as the proper documentation required to ensure efficient and safe operations. Maintenance involves routine checks, troubleshooting, updates, and preventive measures that prolong the lifespan and performance of devices. Documentation, on the other hand, provides a structured record of maintenance activities, system configurations, procedures, and user instructions.</div><p><br></p><p><strong>Learning Objectives:</strong></p><p>This lesson aims to:</p><ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><li>explain the importance of regular maintenance for computer hardware and software;</li><li>identify common maintenance tasks, such as cleaning, updates, backups, and troubleshooting procedures; and</li><li>demonstrate preventive maintenance techniques to ensure optimal system performance.</li></ol>', 6, '', 0, 0, 'English', 0, '2026-04-07 16:10:54', '2026-04-27 00:17:38', '[{\"id\":1776122969344,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":1,\"title\":\"Topic 1: Preventive Maintenance\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1777220247049,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":2,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Once a failure happens, repairs can be both costly. There are preventive measures that you can take to decrease the likelihood of computer problems.[6]</p>\\n<p>The average computer user doesn’t think much about problems that can arise with a computer until a failure actually occurs in the system. Once a failure happens, repairs can be both costly and time-consuming. The good news is that there are some preventive measures that you can take to decrease the likelihood of running into problems with the computer’s smooth and efficient operation and also to lessen any damage that does occur despite best efforts to avoid failures.[6]</p>\\n<p>Preventive maintenance is a type of maintenance strategy that involves regularly checking and servicing equipment or systems to prevent breakdowns and prolong their lifespan. It’s a proactive approach to maintenance that identifies and resolves potential issues before they escalate.[1]</p>\\n<p>Preventive maintenance aims to minimize unexpected downtime, reduce repair costs, and improve the reliability and safety of equipment or systems. This type of maintenance involves performing routine inspections, cleaning, lubrication, calibration, and replacing worn or damaged parts.[1][2]</p>\\n<p>Preventative Maintenance for Computers</p>\\n<p>Like many other pieces of technology, computers see constant wear and tear from being used. Simple things like downloading files, clicking on harmful sites by accident and allowing dust to settle on the keyboard can build up to the computer slowing down and possibly being unusable.[3]</p>\\n<p>Computer failures occur for a variety of reasons, sometimes because of human error and sometimes because of factors in the environment that cause a computer to malfunction or a combination of both. These factors can include excessive buildup of dust, heat or magnetism; viruses picked up from the Internet or from storage media shared between different computers; static electricity shocks or power surges; carelessness, such as spilling liquids into a computer or bumping or dropping the hard drive casing; software that has not been configured correctly or a PC’s setup that has been handled incorrectly, such as incorrect handling of upgrades.[6]</p>\\n<p>Key Aspects of CHS Preventive Maintenance</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969351,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":3,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122969350,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Corrective Maintenance\",\"Preventive Maintenance\",\"Adaptive Maintenance\",\"Perfective Maintenance\"],\"question\":\"What type of maintenance focuses on preventing problems before they occur?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]},{\"id\":1776122969352,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":4,\"title\":\"Topic 2: Extending component lifespan\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1777220247050,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":5,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Aside from what we have discussed from the previous lesson of preventative maintenance, extending the lifespan of computer hardware through servicing involves a combination of regular, proactive maintenance to prevent failure and strategic component upgrades to improve performance. Component level upgrades, along with repairs and maintenance are all about prolonging the lifespan of your device and keeping your technology working for you for longer. [6]</p>\\n<p>Common CHS Maintenance Tasks</p>\\n<p>Operating and Environment Conditions</p>\\n<p>Do not place a PC directly near a heating or cooling source, such as heating vents or air conditioners. Both excessive heat and cold can damage a PC. This includes putting the PC in the path of direct sunlight.</p>\\n<p>Manufacturers often recommend that PCs be in a humidity-controlled environment, but again the PC should not be positioned so that an air conditioner is blowing cool air directly onto the unit (as temperature drops, the likelihood of static electricity increases).</p>\\n<p>Keep the PC’s air vents and fans unobstructed and free of dust.</p>\\n<p>Do not smoke around a PC. Cigarette smoke can damage exposed metal contacts.</p>\\n<p>Do not place a PC near water sources that can splash onto the components or drip down into them. This includes open windows through which rain can come and also under plants that can drip water down into them.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969358,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":6,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122969356,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"To increase internet speed\",\"To prevent overheating and hardware damage\",\"To improve software design\",\"To reduce file size\"],\"question\":\"Why is environmental control important in computer maintenance?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969357,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Reduced hardware lifespan\",\"Faster processing\",\"Better performance\",\"Improved connectivity\"],\"question\":\"Which condition increases the risk of hardware failure?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":0}]},{\"id\":1776122969359,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":7,\"title\":\"Topic 3: Reducing hardware failures\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1777220247051,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":8,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Hardware failure occurs when computer components stop functioning properly due to overheating, electrical issues, wear and tear, improper handling, or lack of preventive maintenance. When hardware components fail, systems may experience data loss, downtime, and costly repairs. Reducing hardware failures requires a systematic approach that includes routine maintenance, environmental control, stable power management, and continuous monitoring to detect early warning signs before they develop into serious system breakdowns. Implementing preventive strategies significantly improves system reliability and extends the operational lifespan of computer equipment.[8]</p>\\n<p>Regular Cleaning and Cooling - Dust accumulation inside the computer chassis blocks airflow and reduces the efficiency of cooling systems, causing internal temperatures to rise. Excessive heat weakens electronic circuits, accelerates component wear, and may eventually lead to permanent hardware damage. Regular cleaning of cooling fans, air vents, heat sinks, and internal components using compressed air helps maintain proper airflow and temperature control. Additionally, arranging cables properly inside the system unit improves ventilation, while placing computers in well-ventilated locations prevents heat buildup. Maintaining an effective cooling environment is one of the most important preventive measures for reducing hardware failures.[7]</p>\\n<p>Power Protection - Electrical instability is another major cause of hardware damage. Sudden power surges, voltage fluctuations, lightning strikes, or unexpected power interruptions can damage power supplies, motherboards, and storage devices. Installing surge protectors, voltage regulators, and uninterruptible power supply (UPS) devices ensures stable power delivery and protects systems from sudden electrical spikes. Proper grounding of electrical systems further reduces the risk of electrical damage by safely redirecting excess voltage. Organizations that implement proper power protection measures significantly reduce the occurrence of unexpected hardware failure.[7]</p>\\n<p>Proper Handling and Installation - Improper handling during installation, repair, or transport may result in physical damage to sensitive components. Electrostatic discharge (ESD), which occurs when static electricity transfers from the technician’s body to electronic parts, can destroy integrated circuits even if the damage is not immediately visible. To prevent this, technicians should always power off and unplug systems before servicing, wear anti-static wrist straps, and handle circuit boards only by their edges. Components should be installed carefully without forcing connectors, ensuring compatibility and correct alignment to prevent mechanical damage.[9]</p>\\n<p>Monitoring and Early Detection - Continuous monitoring of hardware performance helps detect early warning signs of potential failure. Indicators such as unusual noises from fans or hard drives, unexpected system shutdowns, overheating alerts, and declining system performance may signal developing hardware problems. Running built-in diagnostic utilities, checking system temperature readings, and periodically inspecting cables and connectors allow technicians to identify issues early and take corrective action before total component failure occurs. Early detection reduces repair costs and prevents major operational disruptions.[9]</p>\\n<p>Preventive Maintenance Practice - Establishing a routine preventive maintenance program ensures that hardware components are regularly inspected and serviced. Maintenance procedures include cleaning both internal and external components, verifying the operation of cooling systems, replacing worn-out fans, inspecting cables and connectors for damage, testing power supply stability, and updating firmware or hardware drivers to maintain compatibility and performance. A structured maintenance schedule—performed weekly, monthly, quarterly, and annually—helps organizations maintain consistent system performance and reduce unexpected equipment failures.[8]</p>\\n<p>When these preventive strategies are implemented systematically, computer systems operate more efficiently, hardware lifespan is extended, maintenance costs are minimized, and system reliability is significantly improved. Preventive action is therefore essential for both individual users and organizations that rely heavily on computer systems for daily operations.[7][8]</p>\\n<p>Which factor most contributes to hardware failure?</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969363,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":9,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122969361,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Software updates\",\"Dust accumulation\",\"Internet issues\",\"User interface errors\"],\"question\":\"Which factor most contributes to hardware failure?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969362,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Antivirus software\",\"Surge protector\",\"Disk cleaner\",\"Keyboard cover\"],\"question\":\"What is the best solution to prevent damage from power surges?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]},{\"id\":1776122969364,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":10,\"title\":\"Topic 4: Ensuring system reliability\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1777220247052,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":11,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>In modern computing environments, computers must operate consistently and efficiently to support work, communication, education, and business processes. A reliable computer system ensures that hardware and software function properly without frequent failures.</p>\\n<p>System reliability refers to the ability of a computer system to operate continuously without failure over a given period. It includes both hardware functionality and service procedures that support uptime, performance, and safety. A reliable system minimizes interruptions and reduces costly downtime. It involves a proactive, structured approach to maintaining, repairing, and optimizing physical components to prevent failures before they occur. Key strategies include regular maintenance, environmental controls, rigorous testing, and the use of high-quality components to achieve high availability, low, downtime, and consistent performance.[10][11]</p>\\n<p>In computer hardware servicing, technicians must ensure that systems remain stable, secure, and operational through maintenance, monitoring, and proper installation practices.</p>\\n<p>A reliable computer system:</p>\\n<p>Works consistently</p>\\n<p>Produces accurate results</p>\\n<p>Minimizes errors and downtime</p>\\n<p>Without reliability the system may crash, lose data, or interrupt important operations.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969397,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":12,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122969395,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Repair, Access, Safety\",\"Reliability, Availability, Serviceability\",\"Response, Accuracy, Speed\",\"Restore, Analyze, Support\"],\"question\":\"What does RAS stand for in system reliability?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969396,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Maintenance\",\"Fault tolerance\",\"Documentation\",\"Inspection\"],\"question\":\"Which best explains fault tolerance?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]},{\"id\":1776122969398,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":13,\"title\":\"Topic 5: Types of Preventive Maintenance\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1777220247053,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":14,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Preventive maintenance in computer hardware servicing refers to regular and planned actions performed to keep computer systems functioning efficiently and to prevent unexpected failures. Instead of waiting for problems to occur, this approach focuses on maintaining systems in good condition at all times. (refer to topic 1)</p>\\n<p>Preventive maintenance is considered a proactive strategy, meaning that potential issues are identified and resolved before they develop into serious and costly problems. By doing so, technicians and users can avoid sudden system breakdowns, data loss, and expensive repairs.[20]</p>\\n<p>Key Characteristics of Preventive Maintenance:</p>\\n<p>Preventive maintenance is effective because of several important characteristics that guide how it is performed. These characteristics ensure that maintenance activities are organized, efficient, and focused on preventing system failure.</p>\\n<p>Planned and Scheduled</p>\\n<p>Preventive maintenance is carefully planned in advance and performed at regular intervals such as daily, weekly, monthly, or yearly. Instead of waiting for equipment to break down, technicians follow a maintenance schedule based on time, usage, or manufacturer recommendations. This ensures that all necessary tasks are completed on time.[21][22]</p>\\n<p>Routine-Based</p>\\n<p>Preventive maintenance involves repeating regular tasks consistently to keep systems in good condition.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1777220247054,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":15,\"title\":\"Cleaning dust from internal components\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/197_cleaning_dust_from_internal_components_2.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Cleaning dust from internal components\",\"fileName\":\"197_cleaning_dust_from_internal_components_2.webp\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/197_cleaning_dust_from_internal_components_2.webp\",\"fileName\":\"197_cleaning_dust_from_internal_components_2.webp\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<p><strong>Cleaning dust from internal components</strong></p>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/197_cleaning_dust_from_internal_components_2.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Cleaning dust from internal components\",\"fileName\":\"197_cleaning_dust_from_internal_components_2.webp\"}]]},{\"id\":1777220247055,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":16,\"title\":\"Inspecting cables and connections\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/198_inspecting_cables_and_connections_24.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Inspecting cables and connections\",\"fileName\":\"198_inspecting_cables_and_connections_24.webp\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/198_inspecting_cables_and_connections_24.webp\",\"fileName\":\"198_inspecting_cables_and_connections_24.webp\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<p><strong>Inspecting cables and connections</strong></p>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/198_inspecting_cables_and_connections_24.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Inspecting cables and connections\",\"fileName\":\"198_inspecting_cables_and_connections_24.webp\"}]]},{\"id\":1777220247056,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":17,\"title\":\"Updating software and drivers\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/199_updating_software_and_drivers_25.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Updating software and drivers\",\"fileName\":\"199_updating_software_and_drivers_25.webp\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/199_updating_software_and_drivers_25.webp\",\"fileName\":\"199_updating_software_and_drivers_25.webp\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<p><strong>Updating software and drivers</strong></p>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/199_updating_software_and_drivers_25.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Updating software and drivers\",\"fileName\":\"199_updating_software_and_drivers_25.webp\"}]]},{\"id\":1777220247057,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":18,\"title\":\"Running antivirus scans\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/200_running_antivirus_scans_26.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Running antivirus scans\",\"fileName\":\"200_running_antivirus_scans_26.webp\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/200_running_antivirus_scans_26.webp\",\"fileName\":\"200_running_antivirus_scans_26.webp\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<p><strong>Running antivirus scans</strong></p>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/200_running_antivirus_scans_26.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Running antivirus scans\",\"fileName\":\"200_running_antivirus_scans_26.webp\"}]]},{\"id\":1776122969406,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":19,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122969404,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Corrective maintenance\",\"Preventive maintenance\",\"Emergency repair\",\"System replacement\"],\"question\":\"Which maintenance activity is MOST proactive?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969405,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Installing games\",\"Regular maintenance and monitoring\",\"Increasing screen brightness\",\"Using outdated drivers\"],\"question\":\"Which practice best improves system reliability?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]},{\"id\":1776122969407,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":20,\"title\":\"Topic 6: Hardware Preventive Maintenance\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1777220247058,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":21,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Hardware Preventive Maintenance refers to the regular, systematic, and planned care of computer hardware to ensure that all components continue to function efficiently and reliably. Instead of waiting for equipment to break down, this approach focuses on maintaining devices in good working condition to avoid unexpected failures.</p>\\n<p>It involves a variety of tasks such as cleaning internal and external parts, inspecting components for wear and damage, repairing minor issues, and replacing parts before they fail. These activities help maintain optimal system performance and extend the lifespan of the computer.[27]</p>\\n<p>Types of Hardware Preventive Maintenance</p>\\n<p>Cleaning Maintenance</p>\\n<p>One of the most important types of hardware preventive maintenance. It involves the regular removal of dust, dirt, and debris from both the internal and external parts of a computer system to keep it functioning properly.</p>\\n<p>Over time, dust naturally accumulates inside and outside a computer. If not removed, this buildup can block airflow, trap heat, and cause components to overheat or fail.[28]</p>\\n<p>Internal Cleaning</p>\\n<p>Videos to watch:</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1777220247059,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":22,\"title\":\"Fans\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/201_fans_29_crop.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Fans\",\"fileName\":\"201_fans_29_crop.webp\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/201_fans_29_crop.webp\",\"fileName\":\"201_fans_29_crop.webp\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<p><strong>Fans</strong></p>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/201_fans_29_crop.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Fans\",\"fileName\":\"201_fans_29_crop.webp\"}]]},{\"id\":1777220247060,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":23,\"title\":\"Motherboard\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/202_motherboard_30.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Motherboard\",\"fileName\":\"202_motherboard_30.webp\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/202_motherboard_30.webp\",\"fileName\":\"202_motherboard_30.webp\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<p><strong>Motherboard</strong></p>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/202_motherboard_30.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Motherboard\",\"fileName\":\"202_motherboard_30.webp\"}]]},{\"id\":1777220247061,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":24,\"title\":\"Power Supply Vents\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/203_power_supply_vents_31.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Power Supply Vents\",\"fileName\":\"203_power_supply_vents_31.webp\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/203_power_supply_vents_31.webp\",\"fileName\":\"203_power_supply_vents_31.webp\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<p><strong>Power Supply Vents</strong></p>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/203_power_supply_vents_31.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Power Supply Vents\",\"fileName\":\"203_power_supply_vents_31.webp\"}]]},{\"id\":1777220247062,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":25,\"title\":\"Keyboards\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/204_keyboards_32.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Keyboards\",\"fileName\":\"204_keyboards_32.webp\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/204_keyboards_32.webp\",\"fileName\":\"204_keyboards_32.webp\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<p><strong>Keyboards</strong></p>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/204_keyboards_32.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Keyboards\",\"fileName\":\"204_keyboards_32.webp\"}]]},{\"id\":1777220247063,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":26,\"title\":\"Monitors\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/205_monitors_33.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Monitors\",\"fileName\":\"205_monitors_33.webp\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/205_monitors_33.webp\",\"fileName\":\"205_monitors_33.webp\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<p><strong>Monitors</strong></p>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/205_monitors_33.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Monitors\",\"fileName\":\"205_monitors_33.webp\"}]]},{\"id\":1777220247064,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":27,\"title\":\"Ports\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/206_ports_34.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Ports\",\"fileName\":\"206_ports_34.webp\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/206_ports_34.webp\",\"fileName\":\"206_ports_34.webp\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<p><strong>Ports</strong></p>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/206_ports_34.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Ports\",\"fileName\":\"206_ports_34.webp\"}]]},{\"id\":1777220247065,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":28,\"title\":\"System unit casing\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/207_system_unit_casing.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"System unit casing\",\"fileName\":\"207_system_unit_casing.webp\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/207_system_unit_casing.webp\",\"fileName\":\"207_system_unit_casing.webp\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<p><strong>System unit casing</strong></p>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/207_system_unit_casing.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"System unit casing\",\"fileName\":\"207_system_unit_casing.webp\"}]]},{\"id\":1776122969419,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":29,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122969417,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Turn on the system\",\"Spray water directly\",\"Unplug and power off the system\",\"Remove software\"],\"question\":\"What should a technician do before cleaning internal components?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969418,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Install more apps\",\"Clean fans and improve airflow\",\"Increase brightness\",\"Disable antivirus\"],\"question\":\"How can a technician reduce overheating issues?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]},{\"id\":1776122969420,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":30,\"title\":\"Topic 7: Software Preventive Maintenance\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1777220247066,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":31,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Software preventive maintenance refers to the proactive process of improving, updating, and managing software systems to prevent future problems, errors, or failures.</p>\\n<p>Unlike corrective maintenance (which fixes issues after they occur), preventive maintenance focuses on anticipating and avoiding problems before they happen, ensuring long-term system stability, security, and performance.[39]</p>\\n<p>Types of Software Preventive Maintenance</p>\\n<p>Software preventive maintenance is part of broader software maintenance, which includes four main types. Understanding these helps explain how preventive maintenance fits into the system.</p>\\n<p>Corrective Maintenance</p>\\n<p>Corrective maintenance refers to the process of fixing errors, bugs, or faults in a system after they have been detected. Unlike preventive maintenance, which aims to avoid problems, corrective maintenance is performed after an issue occurs.</p>\\n<p>This type of maintenance is necessary to restore the system to its normal working condition and ensure that it continues to function properly.[40]</p>\\n<p>Bug Fixing</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969434,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":32,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122969432,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"To increase RAM\",\"To protect against malware threats\",\"To improve screen resolution\",\"To clean hardware\"],\"question\":\"What is the purpose of antivirus software in maintenance?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969433,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Increase brightness\",\"Install games\",\"Clean keyboard\",\"Backup data regularly\"],\"question\":\"What is the best way to protect data from hardware failure?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":3}]},{\"id\":1776122969435,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":33,\"title\":\"Topic 8: Documentation in Computer Servicing\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1777220247067,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":34,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Documentation in Computer Servicing refers to the systematic recording of all activities, procedures, configurations, and maintenance actions performed on computer systems.</p>\\n<p>It serves as a guide, record, and reference for technicians, ensuring that all servicing tasks are consistent, traceable, and efficient. Proper documentation helps both current and future technicians understand the system’s history and condition.[45]</p>\\n<p>Importance of Documentation</p>\\n<p>Documentation plays a critical role in computer hardware servicing because it ensures that all processes, repairs, and system details are properly recorded and easily accessible. Below are the key reasons why documentation is important:</p>\\n<p>Improves Troubleshooting and Problem Solving</p>\\n<p>Documentation provides a record of previous issues and solutions, allowing technicians to quickly identify and fix recurring problems. This avoids repeating the same steps and speeds up repair time.[46]</p>\\n<p>Increases Efficiency and Saves Time</p>\\n<p>With documented procedures and past cases, technicians can work more efficiently by following proven solutions instead of starting from scratch. This reduces delays and improves productivity.[47]</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969457,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":35,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122969455,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Job Order\",\"Service Report\",\"Maintenance Log\",\"Incident Report\"],\"question\":\"What is the purpose of a maintenance log?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969456,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Ignoring records\",\"Random inspection\",\"Proper documentation\",\"Software update\"],\"question\":\"Which shows proper documentation practice?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2}]}]', '[{\"id\":1776122969627,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Corrective Maintenance\",\"Preventive Maintenance\",\"Adaptive Maintenance\",\"Perfective Maintenance\"],\"question\":\"What type of maintenance focuses on preventing problems before they occur?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969628,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"To increase internet speed\",\"To prevent overheating and hardware damage\",\"To improve software design\",\"To reduce file size\"],\"question\":\"Why is environmental control important in computer maintenance?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969629,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Reduced hardware lifespan\",\"Faster processing\",\"Better performance\",\"Improved connectivity\"],\"question\":\"Which condition increases the risk of hardware failure?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776122969630,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Software updates\",\"Dust accumulation\",\"Internet issues\",\"User interface errors\"],\"question\":\"Which factor most contributes to hardware failure?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969631,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Antivirus software\",\"Surge protector\",\"Disk cleaner\",\"Keyboard cover\"],\"question\":\"What is the best solution to prevent damage from power surges?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969632,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Repair, Access, Safety\",\"Reliability, Availability, Serviceability\",\"Response, Accuracy, Speed\",\"Restore, Analyze, Support\"],\"question\":\"What does RAS stand for in system reliability?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969633,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Maintenance\",\"Fault tolerance\",\"Documentation\",\"Inspection\"],\"question\":\"Which best explains fault tolerance?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969634,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Corrective maintenance\",\"Preventive maintenance\",\"Emergency repair\",\"System replacement\"],\"question\":\"Which maintenance activity is MOST proactive?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969635,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Installing games\",\"Regular maintenance and monitoring\",\"Increasing screen brightness\",\"Using outdated drivers\"],\"question\":\"Which practice best improves system reliability?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969636,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Turn on the system\",\"Spray water directly\",\"Unplug and power off the system\",\"Remove software\"],\"question\":\"What should a technician do before cleaning internal components?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2}]', '[{\"id\":1776122969562,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Corrective Maintenance\",\"Preventive Maintenance\",\"Adaptive Maintenance\",\"Perfective Maintenance\"],\"question\":\"What type of maintenance focuses on preventing problems before they occur?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969563,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"To increase internet speed\",\"To prevent overheating and hardware damage\",\"To improve software design\",\"To reduce file size\"],\"question\":\"Why is environmental control important in computer maintenance?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969564,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Reduced hardware lifespan\",\"Faster processing\",\"Better performance\",\"Improved connectivity\"],\"question\":\"Which condition increases the risk of hardware failure?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776122969565,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Software updates\",\"Dust accumulation\",\"Internet issues\",\"User interface errors\"],\"question\":\"Which factor most contributes to hardware failure?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969566,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Antivirus software\",\"Surge protector\",\"Disk cleaner\",\"Keyboard cover\"],\"question\":\"What is the best solution to prevent damage from power surges?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969567,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Repair, Access, Safety\",\"Reliability, Availability, Serviceability\",\"Response, Accuracy, Speed\",\"Restore, Analyze, Support\"],\"question\":\"What does RAS stand for in system reliability?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969568,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Maintenance\",\"Fault tolerance\",\"Documentation\",\"Inspection\"],\"question\":\"Which best explains fault tolerance?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969569,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Corrective maintenance\",\"Preventive maintenance\",\"Emergency repair\",\"System replacement\"],\"question\":\"Which maintenance activity is MOST proactive?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969570,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Installing games\",\"Regular maintenance and monitoring\",\"Increasing screen brightness\",\"Using outdated drivers\"],\"question\":\"Which practice best improves system reliability?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969571,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Turn on the system\",\"Spray water directly\",\"Unplug and power off the system\",\"Remove software\"],\"question\":\"What should a technician do before cleaning internal components?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969572,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Install more apps\",\"Clean fans and improve airflow\",\"Increase brightness\",\"Disable antivirus\"],\"question\":\"How can a technician reduce overheating issues?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969573,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"To increase RAM\",\"To protect against malware threats\",\"To improve screen resolution\",\"To clean hardware\"],\"question\":\"What is the purpose of antivirus software in maintenance?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969574,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Increase brightness\",\"Install games\",\"Clean keyboard\",\"Backup data regularly\"],\"question\":\"What is the best way to protect data from hardware failure?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":3},{\"id\":1776122969575,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Job Order\",\"Service Report\",\"Maintenance Log\",\"Incident Report\"],\"question\":\"What is the purpose of a maintenance log?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969576,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Ignoring records\",\"Random inspection\",\"Proper documentation\",\"Software update\"],\"question\":\"Which shows proper documentation practice?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969577,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Replacing a broken motherboard\",\"Cleaning dust from internal components\",\"Fixing a corrupted OS\",\"Reinstalling damaged software\"],\"question\":\"Which of the following is part of preventive maintenance?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969578,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Job Order\",\"Maintenance Log\",\"Inventory Record\",\"User Manual\"],\"question\":\"Which document is MOST useful for troubleshooting recurring issues?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969579,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Using surge protectors\",\"Cleaning components regularly\",\"Placing a PC near a window exposed to rain\",\"Updating antivirus software\"],\"question\":\"Which situation shows poor maintenance practice?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969580,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Service Report\",\"Maintenance Log\",\"Job Order\",\"Incident Report\"],\"question\":\"Which document is created before the repair process begins?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969581,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Maintenance\",\"Downtime\",\"Upgrade\",\"Optimization\"],\"question\":\"What is downtime?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]', '[{\"id\":1776122969582,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"To increase hardware speed\",\"To keep a record of system activities\",\"To reduce electricity usage\",\"To improve graphics\"],\"question\":\"A technician records all procedures and configurations for future reference. Why is this done?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969583,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Cleaning maintenance\",\"Inspection maintenance\",\"Replacement maintenance\",\"Corrective maintenance\"],\"question\":\"A technician examines connectors and cables to ensure proper function. What type of maintenance is this?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969584,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"To stabilize voltage and prevent damage\",\"To improve internet speed\",\"To enhance software performance\",\"To reduce file size\"],\"question\":\"An office installs surge protectors for all computers after experiencing electrical fluctuations. What is the purpose?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776122969585,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"It increases monitor brightness\",\"It improves keyboard performance\",\"It prevents accidental deletion of important files\",\"It removes viruses\"],\"question\":\"A technician separates system files from user data to avoid confusion and errors. Why is this important?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969586,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Improved performance\",\"Better connectivity\",\"Faster processing speed\",\"Increased risk of hardware damage\"],\"question\":\"A computer lab has high humidity and dust accumulation. What is the likely effect?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":3},{\"id\":1776122969587,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Slow repair time\",\"Fast processor\",\"Large storage\",\"High resolution\"],\"question\":\"A system is reliable but takes a long time to repair when it fails. What issue affects its availability?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776122969588,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Use water for cleaning\",\"Wear an anti-static wrist strap\",\"Increase temperature\",\"Use magnetic tools\"],\"question\":\"A technician prepares to handle internal components of a computer. What precaution should be taken?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969589,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Ignore the issue\",\"Check cooling system and airflow\",\"Install games\",\"Restart repeatedly\"],\"question\":\"A technician notices rising temperatures and slow performance. What should be done immediately?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969590,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Maintenance Log\",\"Technical Manual\",\"Job Order\",\"Incident Report\"],\"question\":\"A technician needs guidance on how to properly install and maintain a device. Which document should be used?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969591,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Reactive maintenance\",\"Poor system management\",\"Effective preventive maintenance\",\"Emergency repair\"],\"question\":\"A company schedules regular cleaning, updates software, and checks hardware components. What does this show?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969592,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Perfective\",\"Adaptive\",\"Corrective\",\"Preventive\"],\"question\":\"A developer enhances system speed and adds features after deployment. What type of maintenance is this?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776122969593,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Screen damage\",\"Potential system issues\",\"Internet disconnection\",\"File organization\"],\"question\":\"A user ignores warning messages and later experiences system failure. What could have been prevented?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969594,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Overheating and reduced efficiency\",\"Improved airflow\",\"Faster boot time\",\"Increased storage\"],\"question\":\"A computer accumulates dust over time and is not cleaned. What is the effect?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776122969595,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Replace hardware immediately\",\"Repair or reinstall the software\",\"Clean the keyboard\",\"Increase brightness\"],\"question\":\"A technician identifies corrupted files causing repeated crashes. What is the best solution?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969596,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Avoid updates\",\"Regular backups and security measures\",\"Disable antivirus\",\"Ignore maintenance\"],\"question\":\"An organization wants to protect important data from loss, corruption, or attacks. What should they implement?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969612,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Corrective Maintenance\",\"Preventive Maintenance\",\"Adaptive Maintenance\",\"Perfective Maintenance\"],\"question\":\"A technician performs regular cleaning, inspection, and updates on computers to avoid breakdowns. What type of maintenance is being applied?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969613,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"To increase internet speed\",\"To prevent overheating and hardware damage\",\"To improve software design\",\"To reduce file size\"],\"question\":\"A computer lab experiences frequent overheating issues. The technician suggests improving airflow and reducing dust. Why is this important?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969614,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Reduced hardware lifespan\",\"Faster processing\",\"Better performance\",\"Improved connectivity\"],\"question\":\"A computer is placed in a poorly ventilated area with high heat. What is the likely outcome?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776122969615,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Software updates\",\"Dust accumulation\",\"Internet issues\",\"User interface errors\"],\"question\":\"A computer suddenly shuts down frequently. After inspection, heavy dust buildup is found inside. What is the main cause?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969616,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Antivirus software\",\"Surge protector\",\"Disk cleaner\",\"Keyboard cover\"],\"question\":\"A computer was damaged after a sudden power spike. What should be installed to prevent this in the future?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969617,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Repair, Access, Safety\",\"Reliability, Availability, Serviceability\",\"Response, Accuracy, Speed\",\"Restore, Analyze, Support\"],\"question\":\"A student studies system reliability concepts and encounters the acronym RAS. What does it represent?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969618,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Maintenance\",\"Fault tolerance\",\"Documentation\",\"Inspection\"],\"question\":\"A system continues to operate even after one component fails by switching to a backup. What concept is applied?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969619,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Corrective maintenance\",\"Preventive maintenance\",\"Emergency repair\",\"System replacement\"],\"question\":\"A technician wants to avoid future system failures instead of fixing problems after they occur. What should they focus on?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969620,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Installing games\",\"Regular maintenance and monitoring\",\"Increasing screen brightness\",\"Using outdated drivers\"],\"question\":\"A company wants to reduce downtime and ensure systems run continuously. Which action should they prioritize?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969621,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Turn on the system\",\"Spray water directly\",\"Unplug and power off the system\",\"Remove software\"],\"question\":\"A technician is about to clean a computer\'s internal parts. What is the first step to ensure safety?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969622,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Install more apps\",\"Clean fans and improve airflow\",\"Increase brightness\",\"Disable antivirus\"],\"question\":\"A PC frequently overheats during use. Which is the most effective solution?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969623,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"To increase RAM\",\"To protect against malware threats\",\"To improve screen resolution\",\"To clean hardware\"],\"question\":\"A technician installs antivirus software that scans files and updates virus definitions daily. Why is this important?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969624,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Increase brightness\",\"Install games\",\"Clean keyboard\",\"Backup data regularly\"],\"question\":\"A user wants to avoid losing important files if a hard drive fails. What should they do?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":3},{\"id\":1776122969625,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Job Order\",\"Service Report\",\"Maintenance Log\",\"Incident Report\"],\"question\":\"A technician reviews past repairs and upgrades done on a computer over time. Which document is being used?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969626,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Ignoring records\",\"Random inspection\",\"Proper documentation\",\"Software update\"],\"question\":\"A technician records all repairs, parts replaced, and system condition after servicing. What is this practice? QUICK ASSESSMENTS: Topic 1: Preventive Maintenance = Item # 1 = Item # 2 Topic 2: Extending Component Lifespan = Item # 3 = Item # 15 Topic 3: Reducing Hardware Failures = Item # 5 = Item # 7 Topic 4: Ensuring System Reliability = Item # 11 = Item # 16 Topic 5: Types of Preventive Maintenance = Item # 19 = Item # 6 Topic 6: Hardware Preventive Maintenance = Item # 17 = Item # 8 Topic 7: Software Preventive Maintenance = Item # 13 = Item # 18 Topic 8: Documentation in Computer Servicing = Item # 4 = Item # 20\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969597,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"To increase hardware speed\",\"To keep a record of system activities\",\"To reduce electricity usage\",\"To improve graphics\"],\"question\":\"What is the main purpose of documentation in computer servicing?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969598,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Cleaning maintenance\",\"Inspection maintenance\",\"Replacement maintenance\",\"Corrective maintenance\"],\"question\":\"Which maintenance activity involves checking cables and ports for damage?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969599,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"To stabilize voltage and prevent damage\",\"To improve internet speed\",\"To enhance software performance\",\"To reduce file size\"],\"question\":\"Why should computers be connected to a surge protector?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776122969600,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"It increases monitor brightness\",\"It improves keyboard performance\",\"It prevents accidental deletion of important files\",\"It removes viruses\"],\"question\":\"What is the benefit of organizing files properly in a system?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969601,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Improved performance\",\"Better connectivity\",\"Faster processing speed\",\"Increased risk of hardware damage\"],\"question\":\"Which situation indicates poor environmental maintenance?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":3},{\"id\":1776122969602,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Slow repair time\",\"Fast processor\",\"Large storage\",\"High resolution\"],\"question\":\"Which factor most affects system availability?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776122969603,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Use water for cleaning\",\"Wear an anti-static wrist strap\",\"Increase temperature\",\"Use magnetic tools\"],\"question\":\"What should be done to prevent electrostatic discharge (ESD) damage?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969604,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Ignore the issue\",\"Check cooling system and airflow\",\"Install games\",\"Restart repeatedly\"],\"question\":\"What is the best action when a system shows early signs of overheating?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969605,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Maintenance Log\",\"Technical Manual\",\"Job Order\",\"Incident Report\"],\"question\":\"Which document provides detailed instructions from manufacturers?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969606,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Reactive maintenance\",\"Poor system management\",\"Effective preventive maintenance\",\"Emergency repair\"],\"question\":\"Which situation demonstrates effective preventive maintenance?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969607,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Perfective\",\"Adaptive\",\"Corrective\",\"Preventive\"],\"question\":\"Which type of maintenance improves software performance and usability?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776122969608,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Screen damage\",\"Potential system issues\",\"Internet disconnection\",\"File organization\"],\"question\":\"Why is it important to respond to system warnings?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969609,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Overheating and reduced efficiency\",\"Improved airflow\",\"Faster boot time\",\"Increased storage\"],\"question\":\"What is the likely result of not cleaning computer fans regularly?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776122969610,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Replace hardware immediately\",\"Repair or reinstall the software\",\"Clean the keyboard\",\"Increase brightness\"],\"question\":\"What should be done if a system frequently crashes due to software issues?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969611,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Avoid updates\",\"Regular backups and security measures\",\"Disable antivirus\",\"Ignore maintenance\"],\"question\":\"Which practice best ensures long-term data security?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]', '{\"hours\":0,\"minutes\":30}', 'Easy', NULL, '[]');
INSERT INTO `module` (`ModuleID`, `ModuleTitle`, `Description`, `LessonOrder`, `Tesda_Reference`, `Is_Unlocked`, `Is_Completed`, `LessonLanguage`, `Is_Deleted`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `sections`, `diagnosticQuestions`, `reviewQuestions`, `finalQuestions`, `LessonTime`, `Difficulty`, `finalInstruction`, `roadmapStages`) VALUES
(14, 'Pagpapanatili at Dokumentasyon', '<div>Ang araling ito ay nakatuon sa mahahalagang gawain sa pagpapanatili ng mga computer system, software, at hardware, pati na rin ang tamang dokumentasyon na kinakailangan upang masiguro ang maayos at ligtas na operasyon. Ang pagpapanatili ay kinabibilangan ng mga rutin na pagsusuri, pag-aayos ng problema (troubleshooting), pag-update, at mga hakbang na pang-iwas na nagpapahaba sa buhay at nagpapahusay sa performance ng mga device. Samantala, ang dokumentasyon ay nagbibigay ng organisadong talaan ng mga gawain sa maintenance, configuration ng system, mga proseso, at mga tagubilin para sa mga gumagamit.</div><p><br></p><p><strong>Mga Layunin:</strong></p><p>Layunin ng araling ito na:</p><ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><li>Ipaliwanag ang kahalagahan ng regular na pagpapanatili ng computer hardware at software;</li><li>tukuyin ang mga karaniwang gawain sa maintenance tulad ng paglilinis, pag-update, pagba-backup, at mga proseso ng troubleshooting; at</li><li>ipakita ang mga teknik sa preventive maintenance upang masiguro ang pinakamainam na performance ng system.</li></ol>', 6, '', 0, 0, 'Taglish', 0, '2026-04-07 16:10:54', '2026-04-25 23:41:54', '[{\"id\":1776122969459,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":1,\"title\":\"Paksa 1: Preventive Maintenance (Pang-iwas na Pagpapanatili)\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969460,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":2,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Kapag nagkaroon na ng sira, ang pag-aayos ay maaaring maging magastos. May mga hakbang na pang-iwas na maaari mong gawin upang mabawasan ang posibilidad ng pagkakaroon ng problema sa computer.</p><p>Ang karaniwang gumagamit ng computer ay hindi gaanong nag-iisip tungkol sa mga posibleng problema hanggang sa magkaroon ng sira ang system. Kapag nangyari ito, ang pag-aayos ay maaaring maging magastos at matagal gawin. Ang magandang balita ay may mga preventive measures na maaari mong gawin upang mabawasan ang posibilidad ng pagkakaroon ng problema sa maayos at episyenteng operasyon ng computer, at upang mabawasan din ang pinsala sakaling magkaroon pa rin ng aberya kahit may pag-iingat.</p><p>Ang preventive maintenance ay isang uri ng estratehiya sa pagpapanatili kung saan regular na sinusuri at inaayos ang mga kagamitan o system upang maiwasan ang pagkasira at mapahaba ang kanilang buhay. Isa itong proactive na paraan kung saan natutukoy at naaayos ang mga posibleng problema bago pa ito lumala.</p><p>Layunin ng preventive maintenance na mabawasan ang hindi inaasahang downtime, mapababa ang gastos sa pagkukumpuni, at mapabuti ang pagiging maaasahan at kaligtasan ng mga kagamitan o system. Kabilang dito ang regular na inspeksyon, paglilinis, pagpapadulas (lubrication), pagkakalibrate, at pagpapalit ng mga sirâ o luma nang bahagi.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969461,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"subtopic\",\"order\":3,\"title\":\"Preventive Maintenance para sa mga Computer\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969462,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":4,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Tulad ng ibang uri ng teknolohiya, ang mga computer ay nakakaranas ng patuloy na pagkasira o wear and tear dahil sa paggamit. Ang mga simpleng gawain tulad ng pagda-download ng files, aksidenteng pag-click sa mga mapanganib na website, at pag-ipon ng alikabok sa keyboard ay maaaring magdulot ng pagbagal ng computer at sa kalaunan ay maging hindi na ito magamit.</p><p>Ang pagkasira ng computer ay maaaring mangyari sa iba’t ibang dahilan—minsan dahil sa pagkakamali ng tao, at minsan naman dahil sa mga salik sa kapaligiran na nagdudulot ng malfunction, o kombinasyon ng dalawa. Kabilang sa mga salik na ito ang labis na pag-ipon ng alikabok, init, o magnetism; mga virus na nakukuha mula sa internet o mula sa mga storage media na ginagamit sa iba’t ibang computer; static electricity o biglaang pagtaas ng kuryente (power surge); kapabayaan tulad ng pagbuhos ng likido sa computer o pagkabagsak ng hard drive; at maling pag-configure ng software o hindi tamang pag-set up ng PC, gaya ng maling pag-handle ng mga upgrade.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969463,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"subtopic\",\"order\":5,\"title\":\"Mahahalagang Aspeto ng Preventive Maintenance sa CHS\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969464,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":6,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: none;\\\"><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\"><strong>Sistematikong Paglilinis (Systematic Cleaning) </strong>– Regular na pag-aalis ng alikabok sa mga bahagi ng computer (tulad ng motherboard, fans, at power supply) upang maiwasan ang sobrang init (overheating).</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\"><strong>Nakatakdang Inspeksyon (Scheduled Inspection)</strong> – Pagsusuri ng mga maluluwag na kable, sirang bahagi, at mga luma o pudpod na piyesa bago pa ito magdulot ng problema.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\"><strong>Pagpapanatili ng Software (Software Maintenance)</strong> – Pag-install ng mga security patch, pagpapatakbo ng antivirus scan, at pag-update ng mga driver upang maiwasan ang mga isyu sa system.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\"><strong>Kontrol sa Kapaligiran (Environmental Control)</strong> – Pagpapanatiling malinis ng paligid ng computer at pagsisiguro ng maayos na bentilasyon upang maprotektahan laban sa alikabok at init.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\"><strong>Dokumentasyon (Documentation)</strong> – Pagpapanatili ng mga talaan ng maintenance upang masubaybayan ang performance ng kagamitan.</li></ul>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969467,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":7,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122969465,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Corrective Maintenance\",\"Preventive Maintenance\",\"Adaptive Maintenance\",\"Perfective Maintenance\"],\"question\":\"Anong uri ng maintenance ang nakatuon sa pag-iwas sa mga problema bago pa ito mangyari?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969466,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Pagpapalit ng sirang motherboard\",\"Paglilinis ng alikabok sa loob ng mga bahagi ng computer\",\"Pag-aayos ng sirang operating system\",\"Muling pag-install ng nasirang software\"],\"question\":\"Alin sa mga sumusunod ang bahagi ng preventive maintenance?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]},{\"id\":1776122969468,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":8,\"title\":\"Paksa 2: Pagpapahaba ng Buhay ng mga Bahagi (Extending Component Lifespan)\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969469,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":9,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Bukod sa mga natalakay na natin sa nakaraang aralin tungkol sa preventive maintenance, ang pagpapahaba ng buhay ng computer hardware sa pamamagitan ng servicing ay kinabibilangan ng regular at maagap na pagpapanatili upang maiwasan ang pagkasira, pati na rin ang mga estratehikong pag-upgrade ng mga bahagi upang mapabuti ang performance.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969470,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"subtopic\",\"order\":10,\"title\":\"Karaniwang Gawain sa CHS Maintenance\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969471,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":11,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Mga Kondisyon sa Operasyon at Kapaligiran</strong><ul data-indent-group=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"padding-left: 1.25rem; margin: 0.25rem 0 0.2rem; list-style-type: none;\\\"><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Huwag ilagay ang PC malapit sa pinagmumulan ng init o lamig, tulad ng heating vents o air conditioner. Ang sobrang init o lamig ay maaaring makasira sa PC. Kasama rito ang paglalagay ng PC sa direktang sikat ng araw.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Karaniwang nirerekomenda ng mga manufacturer na ilagay ang PC sa lugar na may kontroladong humidity, ngunit hindi rin ito dapat ilagay sa lugar na direktang tinatamaan ng malamig na hangin mula sa aircon (dahil habang bumababa ang temperatura, tumataas ang posibilidad ng static electricity).</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Panatilihing hindi nakaharang at malinis sa alikabok ang mga air vents at fans ng PC.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Huwag manigarilyo malapit sa PC. Ang usok ng sigarilyo ay maaaring makasira sa mga exposed na metal contacts.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Huwag ilagay ang PC malapit sa mga pinagmumulan ng tubig na maaaring tumalsik o tumulo sa mga bahagi nito. Kasama rito ang mga bukas na bintana na maaaring pasukan ng ulan at ang paglalagay nito sa ilalim ng mga halaman na maaaring tumulo ang tubig.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Huwag direktang isaksak ang power source sa wall outlet; sa halip, gumamit muna ng surge protector. Pinipigilan nito ang electrical surges na maaaring makasira sa hard drive at magbura ng data.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Ang pag-ipon ng alikabok ay maaaring makaapekto sa kakayahan ng PC na magpalamig. Kahit hindi binubuksan ang case ng computer, maaaring pumasok ang alikabok sa pamamagitan ng mga openings. Nakakaapekto rin ito sa haba ng buhay ng hardware. Isang mabisang paraan ng paglilinis ay ang paggamit ng compressed air upang hipan ang alikabok palayo sa motherboard at iba pang bahagi.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Laging patayin at tanggalin sa saksakan ang system bago linisin ang loob ng case. Mahalaga rin na i-ground ang sarili upang maiwasan ang static electricity bago humawak ng anumang bahagi sa loob.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Mag-ingat nang husto kapag inililipat ang PC mula sa isang lugar patungo sa iba. Kahit maliit na pagyanig ay maaaring makaluwag o makapagtanggal ng mga chips at expansion boards, kaya siguraduhing naka-off ang system bago ito ilipat, kahit pa sa kabilang bahagi lang ng mesa.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Itago ang lahat ng dokumentasyon na kasama ng PC at mga bahagi nito. Maaaring kailanganin ito kung may problema na mangyari.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Laging i-shutdown nang maayos ang system (sa Windows, gamitin ang Start → Shutdown) kung maaari. Mahalaga ring pansinin at tugunan ang mga babala at error messages upang maiwasan ang posibleng pagkawala o pagkasira ng data.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Operating System at Maintenance</strong><ul data-indent-group=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"padding-left: 1.25rem; margin: 0.25rem 0 0.2rem; list-style-type: none;\\\"><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Siguraduhing naida-download at na-install mo ang pinakabagong patches at service updates para sa iyong operating system, lalo na kung Windows-based ang PC. Nakakatulong ang mga update na ito sa pag-aayos ng bugs at pagprotekta laban sa security exploits.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Panatilihing maayos ang root directory. Ilagay lamang dito ang mga startup at software initialization files ng system. Ang mga application files at data nito ay dapat nasa hiwalay na directory.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Huwag mag-imbak ng data files sa parehong directory kung saan naka-save ang software. Makakatulong ito upang maiwasan ang aksidenteng pagbura o pag-overwrite ng mga software file.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Magkaroon ng backup rescue disks para sa operating system.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Magtago ng detalyadong talaan ng default settings, mga pagbabagong ginawa sa CMOS setup na naiiba sa default, at lahat ng maintenance na isinagawa sa system. Makakatulong ang mga talaang ito sa pag-troubleshoot at magiging mahalaga rin kung mag-u-upgrade ng mga bahagi ng system. Posible ring mawala ang settings ng CMOS, kaya mahalagang may rekord ka upang maibalik ang mga ito.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Magtago ng backup copies ng mahahalagang data sa mga removable media. Maaaring masira ang hard drive, kaya ang pagkakaroon ng kopya sa ibang storage ay makakaiwas sa stress at problema.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Kung maaari, gumamit ng pangalawang hard drive para sa pag-save ng files. Ang pangunahing drive na mas madalas gamitin ay mas mabilis masira kumpara sa secondary drive na hindi gaanong ginagamit.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Pagpapanatili ng Hardware at Hard Drive</strong><ul data-indent-group=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"padding-left: 1.25rem; margin: 0.25rem 0 0.2rem; list-style-type: none;\\\"><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Magtago ng mga tala tungkol sa anumang expansion cards na iyong ini-install at ang mga hakbang na iyong sinunod sa pag-install nito.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Mayroong disk cleanup function ang Windows na nag-aalis ng mga temporary files na nalilikha ng mga programa. Nakakatulong ito upang makapagbakante ng karagdagang espasyo sa hard drive.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Pahabain ang buhay ng iyong computer monitor sa pamamagitan ng pagpatay nito kapag hindi ginagamit.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Siguraduhing i-update ang mga driver at software ng iyong mga expansion cards, tulad ng video o sound cards. Sa paggamit ng updated drivers, mas magiging maayos at mahusay ang pagtakbo ng iyong hardware.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Pagpapanatili ng Software</strong><ul data-indent-group=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"padding-left: 1.25rem; margin: 0.25rem 0 0.2rem; list-style-type: none;\\\"><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Magtago ng backup na kopya ng orihinal na software, tulad ng nasa CD o DVD. Ang ganitong uri ng pagkopya ng software ay legal.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Mag-ingat sa pag-install ng file sharing at iba pang peer-to-peer software dahil maaari itong magdulot ng panganib sa seguridad ng iyong PC. Kahit na ligtas at walang virus ang software mismo, ang pagbabahagi at pagda-download ng files mula sa ibang users ay maaaring magdala ng panganib.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Alisin ang mga hindi na ginagamit na software upang makapagpalaya ng karagdagang system resources at espasyo sa hard disk. Sa Windows PC, gamitin ang “Add/Remove Programs” mula sa Control Panel upang mag-uninstall ng software.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Para sa mas maayos na performance ng system, iwasan ang paggamit ng shareware o freeware na wallpaper, screensavers, at mga katulad na audio at visual na apps. Karaniwan, nangangailangan ang mga ito ng dagdag na system resources upang gumana.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Proteksyon sa Antivirus</strong><ul data-indent-group=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"padding-left: 1.25rem; margin: 0.25rem 0 0.2rem; list-style-type: none;\\\"><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Mag-install ng antivirus program na awtomatikong nagsasagawa ng virus scan sa tuwing nagbo-boot ang system.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Kapag mayroon ka nang antivirus program, kailangan mong i-update araw-araw ang virus definitions upang masiguro na protektado ang iyong system laban sa pinakabagong banta.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Huwag mag-download ng anumang file mula sa Internet maliban kung sigurado kang ligtas ang pinagmulan at hindi naglalaman ng virus.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Huwag gumamit ng anumang storage media na ginamit sa ibang computer maliban kung sigurado kang virus-free ang ibang computer at hindi nito maipapasa ang virus sa iyong system.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Huwag buksan ang mga email attachments mula sa mga taong hindi mo kilala; at huwag rin buksan ang anumang file attachment na nagtatapos sa ‘.exe’. Lahat ng downloaded files ay dapat i-scan muna gamit ang antivirus bago patakbuhin o i-install.</li></ul></li></ul><p>Ang pagpapahaba ng buhay ng mga bahagi ng computer ay nakasalalay sa regular na preventive maintenance, tamang kondisyon ng operasyon, at wastong pangangalaga sa software. Ang pagpapanatili ng PC sa maayos na bentilasyon, walang alikabok na kapaligiran, at pagprotekta nito laban sa init, kahalumigmigan, at biglaang pagtaas ng kuryente (power surges) ay nakakatulong upang maiwasan ang maagang pagkasira ng hardware.</p><p>Ang rutin na maintenance — tulad ng paglilinis ng alikabok, pamamahala ng airflow, at pag-update ng drivers at firmware — ay nagpapanatiling maayos ang paggana ng mga bahagi at nagpapababa ng wear and tear. Bukod dito, ang pagpapanatili ng software (pag-install ng updates sa system at drivers, pagtanggal ng hindi ginagamit na programa, at pag-backup ng data) ay sumusuporta sa katatagan ng system at nagpoprotekta laban sa mga isyu na maaaring makaapekto sa performance ng hardware.</p><p>Sa kabuuan, ang mga gawi na ito ay tumutulong na pahabain ang paggamit ng device, bawasan ang pangangailangan sa pagkukumpuni, at mapanatili ang pagiging maaasahan ng system.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969474,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":12,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122969472,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Para mapabilis ang internet\",\"Para maiwasan ang overheating at pagkasira ng hardware\",\"Para mapabuti ang disenyo ng software\",\"Para mabawasan ang laki ng files\"],\"question\":\"Bakit mahalaga ang kontrol sa kapaligiran (environmental control) sa maintenance ng computer?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969473,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Pagbaba ng haba ng buhay ng hardware\",\"Mas mabilis na processing\",\"Mas magandang performance\",\"Mas maayos na koneksyon\"],\"question\":\"Aling kondisyon ang nagpapataas ng panganib ng pagkasira ng hardware?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":0}]},{\"id\":1776122969475,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":13,\"title\":\"Paksa 3: Pagbabawas ng Pagkasira ng Hardware\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969476,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":14,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Ang pagkasira ng hardware ay nangyayari kapag humihinto sa maayos na paggana ang mga bahagi ng computer dahil sa sobrang init, problema sa kuryente, wear and tear, maling paghawak, o kakulangan sa preventive maintenance. Kapag nag-fail ang mga hardware components, maaaring maranasan ng system ang pagkawala ng data, downtime, at magastos na pagkukumpuni.</p><p>Ang pagbabawas ng pagkasira ng hardware ay nangangailangan ng sistematikong paraan na kinabibilangan ng rutin na maintenance, kontrol sa kapaligiran, maayos at matatag na pamamahala ng kuryente, at patuloy na pagmamanman upang matukoy ang mga paunang senyales bago pa ito lumala at magdulot ng seryosong pagkasira ng system. Ang pagpapatupad ng mga preventive strategies ay malaki ang naitutulong sa pagpapabuti ng pagiging maaasahan ng system at pagpapahaba ng operational lifespan ng kagamitan ng computer.</p><ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Regular na Paglilinis at Pagpapalamig</strong> - Ang pag-ipon ng alikabok sa loob ng computer chassis ay nakakaharang sa airflow at nagpapababa sa bisa ng cooling system, na nagdudulot ng pagtaas ng internal na temperatura. Ang sobrang init ay nagpapahina sa electronic circuits, nagpapabilis ng pagkasira ng mga bahagi, at maaaring magdulot ng permanenteng pinsala sa hardware. Ang regular na paglilinis ng cooling fans, air vents, heat sinks, at mga internal na bahagi gamit ang compressed air ay nakakatulong upang mapanatili ang maayos na airflow at kontrol sa temperatura. Bukod dito, ang maayos na pag-aayos ng mga kable sa loob ng system unit ay nagpapabuti sa bentilasyon, habang ang paglalagay ng mga computer sa maayos na bentiladong lugar ay nakakaiwas sa pag-ipon ng init. Ang pagpapanatili ng epektibong cooling environment ay isa sa pinakamahalagang hakbang sa preventive maintenance upang mabawasan ang pagkasira ng hardware.</li><li><strong>Proteksyon sa Kuryente (Power Protection)</strong> - Ang hindi matatag na suplay ng kuryente ay isa pang pangunahing dahilan ng pinsala sa hardware. Ang biglaang power surges, pagbabago-bago ng boltahe, kidlat, o hindi inaasahang pagkawala ng kuryente ay maaaring makasira sa power supplies, motherboards, at storage devices. Ang pag-install ng surge protectors, voltage regulators, at uninterruptible power supply (UPS) ay nakasisiguro ng matatag na suplay ng kuryente at pinoprotektahan ang system laban sa biglaang electrical spikes. Ang tamang grounding ng electrical system ay nakababawas din ng panganib ng pinsala sa kuryente sa pamamagitan ng ligtas na pag-redirect ng sobrang boltahe. Ang mga organisasyon na nagpapatupad ng wastong hakbang sa proteksyon ng kuryente ay malaki ang nababawasan sa insidente ng hindi inaasahang pagkasira ng hardware.</li><li><strong>Wastong Paghawak at Pag-install</strong> - Ang maling paghawak sa panahon ng pag-install, pagkukumpuni, o paglilipat ay maaaring magdulot ng pisikal na pinsala sa mga sensitibong bahagi. Ang electrostatic discharge (ESD), na nangyayari kapag ang static electricity mula sa katawan ng technician ay naililipat sa mga electronic parts, ay maaaring makasira sa integrated circuits kahit na hindi agad nakikita ang pinsala. Upang maiwasan ito, dapat laging patayin at i-unplug ng technician ang system bago magsagawa ng maintenance, magsuot ng anti-static wrist strap, at hawakan lamang ang circuit boards sa kanilang mga gilid. Dapat ding maingat na i-install ang mga bahagi nang hindi pinipilit ang mga connectors, siguraduhing tugma ang mga bahagi at tama ang pagkaka-align upang maiwasan ang mekanikal na pinsala.</li><li><strong>Pagmamanman at Maagang Pagtuklas (Monitoring and Early Detection)</strong> - Ang patuloy na pagmamanman sa performance ng hardware ay nakakatulong upang matukoy ang mga paunang senyales ng posibleng pagkasira. Ang mga palatandaan tulad ng kakaibang tunog mula sa fans o hard drives, hindi inaasahang pag-shutdown ng system, overheating alerts, at pagbaba ng performance ng system ay maaaring magpahiwatig ng nagde-develop na problema sa hardware. Ang paggamit ng built-in diagnostic utilities, pagsuri sa mga system temperature readings, at pana-panahong inspeksyon ng mga kable at connectors ay nagbibigay-daan sa mga technician na maagang matukoy ang mga isyu at magsagawa ng tamang aksyon bago tuluyang masira ang component. Ang maagang pagtuklas ay nakababawas sa gastos sa pagkukumpuni at nakakaiwas sa malalaking aberya sa operasyon.</li><li><strong>Gawi sa Preventive Maintenance (Preventive Maintenance Practice)</strong> - Ang pagtatatag ng isang rutin na preventive maintenance program ay nakasisiguro na ang mga bahagi ng hardware ay regular na nasusuri at napapanatili. Kasama sa mga maintenance procedure ang paglilinis ng mga internal at external na bahagi, pagsusuri sa paggana ng cooling systems, pagpapalit ng mga luma o sirang fans, inspeksyon ng mga kable at connectors para sa pinsala, pagsubok sa katatagan ng power supply, at pag-update ng firmware o hardware drivers upang mapanatili ang compatibility at performance. Ang isang maayos na maintenance schedule — na isinasagawa linggu-linggo, buwan-buwan, quarterly, at taun-taon — ay tumutulong sa mga organisasyon na mapanatili ang tuloy-tuloy na performance ng system at mabawasan ang hindi inaasahang pagkasira ng kagamitan.</li></ol><p>Kapag ang mga preventive strategies na ito ay ipinatupad nang sistematiko, mas maayos ang paggana ng mga computer system, humahaba ang buhay ng hardware, nababawasan ang gastos sa maintenance, at lubos na napapabuti ang pagiging maaasahan ng system. Kaya’t ang mga hakbang na pang-iwas ay mahalaga para sa parehong indibidwal na gumagamit at mga organisasyon na malaki ang pag-asa sa computer systems para sa kanilang pang-araw-araw na operasyon.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969479,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":15,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122969477,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Software updates\",\"Pag-ipon ng alikabok\",\"Problema sa internet\",\"Error sa user interface\"],\"question\":\"Aling salik ang pinaka-nakakaambag sa pagkasira ng hardware?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969478,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Antivirus software\",\"Surge protector\",\"Disk cleaner\",\"Keyboard cover\"],\"question\":\"Ano ang pinakamainam na solusyon upang maiwasan ang pinsala dulot ng power surge?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]},{\"id\":1776122969480,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":16,\"title\":\"Paksa 4: Pagtiyak ng Pagiging Maaasahan ng System (Ensuring System Reliability)\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969481,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":17,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Sa makabagong computing environment, ang mga computer ay kailangang gumana nang tuloy-tuloy at episyente upang suportahan ang trabaho, komunikasyon, edukasyon, at mga proseso ng negosyo. Ang isang maaasahang computer system ay nakasisiguro na ang hardware at software ay gumagana nang maayos nang hindi madalas masira.</p><p>Ang pagiging maaasahan ng system (system reliability) ay tumutukoy sa kakayahan ng isang computer system na gumana nang tuloy-tuloy nang walang pagkasira sa loob ng isang takdang panahon. Saklaw nito ang parehong functionality ng hardware at mga service procedures na sumusuporta sa uptime, performance, at kaligtasan. Ang isang maaasahang system ay nagpapababa ng mga pagkaantala at nagbabawas ng magastos na downtime. Ito ay nangangailangan ng proaktibo at organisadong pamamaraan sa pagpapanatili, pagkukumpuni, at pag-optimize ng mga pisikal na bahagi upang maiwasan ang pagkasira bago pa man ito mangyari.</p><p>Kabilang sa mga pangunahing estratehiya ang regular na maintenance, kontrol sa kapaligiran, masusing testing, at paggamit ng mataas na kalidad na mga bahagi upang makamit ang mataas na availability, mababang downtime, at tuloy-tuloy na performance.</p><p>Sa computer hardware servicing, ang mga technician ay dapat tiyakin na ang mga system ay nananatiling stable, secure, at operational sa pamamagitan ng maintenance, pagmamanman, at tamang pamamaraan ng pag-install.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969482,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"subtopic\",\"order\":18,\"title\":\"Ang isang maaasahang computer system ay\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969483,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":19,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Gumagana nang tuloy-tuloy</li><li>Nagbibigay ng tumpak na resulta</li><li>Nagbabawas ng mga error at downtime</li></ul><p>Kung walang pagiging maaasahan, ang system ay maaaring mag-crash, mawalan ng data, o makaistorbo sa mahahalagang operasyon.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969484,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"subtopic\",\"order\":20,\"title\":\"Pangunahing Konsepto ng Pagiging Maaasahan ng System (Key Concepts of System Reliability)\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969485,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":21,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Reliability, Availability, at Serviceability (RAS)</strong></li></ol><p>Ang pagiging maaasahan ng system sa computer hardware servicing ay madalas ipinaliwanag gamit ang konsepto ng RAS, na nangangahulugang Reliability, Availability, at Serviceability. Ang tatlong prinsipyong ito ay ginagamit din sa IT industry upang suriin kung gaano kahusay gumagana ang isang computer system sa paglipas ng panahon at kung gaano kaepektibo itong makabawi mula sa mga problema.</p><ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Reliability (Pagiging Maaasahan)</strong> - Ang reliability ay tumutukoy sa kakayahan ng isang computer system o hardware component na gampanan ang kanyang nakatakdang tungkulin nang tuloy-tuloy at walang pagkasira sa loob ng isang takdang panahon.</li></ol><p>Ang mababang reliability ay nagdudulot ng madalas na pagkasira ng system, na maaaring magresulta sa downtime, pagkawala ng data, at pagbaba ng produktibidad.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969486,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":22,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":{\"rows\":[[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Gumagana nang walang hindi inaasahang pag-crash o error</li><li>Pinananatili ang matatag na performance sa normal at mabibigat na workload</li><li>Pinoprotektahan ang data laban sa corruption o pagkawala</li></ul>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Kalidad ng mga bahagi ng hardware (halimbawa, branded kumpara sa generic na piyesa)</li><li>Kondisyon ng kapaligiran (init, alikabok, halumigmig)</li><li>Wastong pag-install at pagkaka-configure</li><li>Regular na maintenance (paglilinis, pag-update, pagsusuri/diagnostics)</li></ul>\"]],\"headers\":[\"<p><strong>Mga Katangian ng Isang Maaasahang System (Characteristics of a Reliable System):</strong></p>\",\"<p><strong>Mga Salik na Nakaaapekto sa Reliability (Factors Affecting Reliability):</strong></p>\"]},\"contentLayout\":\"table\"},{\"id\":1776122969487,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":23,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Availability (Pagiging Magagamit)</strong> - Ang availability ay ang sukatan kung gaano kadalas magagamit at handa ang isang system kapag kinakailangan. Kahit na maaasahan ang isang system, kailangan din itong maging available sa mga gumagamit sa tamang oras.</li></ol><p>Ang mataas na availability ay nagsisiguro na ang mga gumagamit ay maaaring makagamit ng system anumang oras na kailangan nila, na kritikal sa mga negosyo, ospital, at online na serbisyo.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969488,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":24,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":{\"rows\":[[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Mataas na Uptime</li><li>Minimal na Downtime</li><li>Mabilis na Pagbangon (Fast Recovery) – kayang mabilis na i-restart o maibalik ang serbisyo ng system pagkatapos ng crash o pagkawala ng kuryente</li><li>Fault Tolerance – patuloy na gumagana kahit may pumalyang bahagi ng hardware</li></ul>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Pagiging maaasahan ng system (mas kaunting pagkasira = mas mataas na uptime)</li><li>Bilis ng pagkukumpuni (haba ng downtime)</li><li>Mga backup system at redundancy</li><li>Katatagan ng network at suplay ng kuryente</li></ul>\"]],\"headers\":[\"<p><strong>Mga Katangian ng Isang Magagamit na System (Characteristics of an Available System):</strong></p>\",\"<p><strong>Mga Salik na Nakaaapekto sa Availability (Factors Affecting Availability):</strong></p>\"]},\"contentLayout\":\"table\"},{\"id\":1776122969489,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":25,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Serviceability (Kakayahang Mapanatili at Maayos ang System)</strong> - Ang serviceability ay tumutukoy sa kung gaano kadali at kabilis maayos, mapanatili, o ma-upgrade ang isang system kapag nagkaroon ng problema.</li></ol><p>Ang mahusay na serviceability ay nagpapababa ng downtime at gastos sa maintenance, na nagpapabuti sa kabuuang performance ng system at kasiyahan ng gumagamit.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969490,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":26,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":{\"rows\":[[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>May mga madaling palitang bahagi (modular na disenyo)</li><li>Nagbibigay ng malinaw na error messages o diagnostic tools</li><li>May kasamang madaling ma-access na dokumentasyon at suporta</li><li>Pinapadali ang mabilis na troubleshooting at pagkukumpuni</li></ul>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Disenyo ng system (tool-less cases, naka-label na mga bahagi)</li><li>Pagkakaroon ng spare parts</li><li>Antas ng kasanayan ng technician</li><li>Suporta at dokumentasyon mula sa manufacturer</li></ul>\"]],\"headers\":[\"<p><strong>Mga Katangian ng Isang Maaasahang System (Characteristics of a Reliable System):</strong></p>\",\"<p><strong>Mga Salik na Nakaaapekto sa Availability (Factors Affecting Availability):</strong></p>\"]},\"contentLayout\":\"table\"},{\"id\":1776122969491,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":27,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Ugnayan ng Reliability, Availability, at Serviceability</strong></li></ol>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969492,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"subtopic\",\"order\":28,\"title\":\"Ang tatlong konseptong ito ay magkakaugnay\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969493,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":29,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<table><thead><tr><th><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Ang mataas na reliability ay nagpapababa ng posibilidad ng pagkasira</li><li>Ang mataas na serviceability ay nagsisiguro ng mabilis na pagbangon kapag nagkaroon ng pagkasira </li></ul></th></tr></thead></table><p>Ang isang system na bihirang masira ngunit matagal ayusin ay maaari pa ring magkaroon ng mababang availability. Gayundin, ang isang system na madalas masira ngunit mabilis ay maayos ay maaaring mapanatili ang katamtamang availability.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969494,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"subtopic\",\"order\":30,\"title\":\"2. Fault Tolerance (Kakayahang Tanggapin ang Pagkasira)\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969495,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":31,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Ang fault tolerance ay ang kakayahan ng isang computer system na magpatuloy sa maayos na paggana kahit na may isa o higit pang bahagi nito ang pumalya. Sa halip na huminto nang tuluyan, natutukoy ng system ang problema at awtomatikong lumilipat sa backup na bahagi o alternatibong proseso upang mapanatili ang operasyon.</p><p>Sa simpleng salita, ang isang fault-tolerant system ay idinisenyo upang ang mga pagkasira ay hindi makaistorbo sa karanasan ng gumagamit.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969496,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"subtopic\",\"order\":32,\"title\":\"Ang fault tolerance ay nakakamit sa pamamagitan ng ilang teknik\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969497,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":33,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":{\"rows\":[[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Error Detection</strong></li></ul>\",\"<p>Patuloy na sinusuri ng system ang mga problema (halimbawa, hardware monitoring, system logs)</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Error Recovery</strong></li></ul>\",\"<p>Kapag natukoy ang isang fault, awtomatikong inaayos o nilalampasan ito ng system</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Failover Mechanism</strong></li></ul>\",\"<p>Awtomatikong paglilipat sa standby system kapag may pagkasira sa pangunahing system</p>\"]],\"headers\":[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Redundancy</strong></li></ul>\",\"<p>Pagdagdag ng karagdagang bahagi (backup power supply, dagdag na servers, duplicate na disks)</p>\"]},\"contentLayout\":\"table\"},{\"id\":1776122969498,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"subtopic\",\"order\":34,\"title\":\"Mga Uri ng Faults (Types of Faults)\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969499,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":35,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Sa anumang computer system, maaaring mangyari ang faults (o failures) nang biglaan at makaistorbo sa normal na operasyon. Mahalaga ang pag-unawa sa iba\'t ibang uri ng faults upang makapagdisenyo ng mga system na kayang magpatuloy sa paggana kahit may mga problema. Ang mga fault-tolerant system ay partikular na idinisenyo upang matukoy, ma-isolate, at makabawi mula sa mga faults na ito nang may kaunting downtime o walang downtime man lang.</p><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: none;\\\"><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\"><strong>Hardware Faults</strong> – Nangyayari kapag ang mga pisikal na bahagi ng computer system ay pumalya o nag-malfunction. Madalas itong sanhi ng wear and tear, sobrang init, problema sa kuryente, o depekto sa paggawa.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\"><strong>Software Faults</strong> – Mga error sa loob ng mga programa o operating system na nagdudulot ng maling o hindi inaasahang pag-uugali. Karaniwang sanhi nito ang pagkakamali sa coding, compatibility issues, o corrupt na files.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\"><strong>Network Faults</strong> – Nangyayari kapag naapektuhan ang komunikasyon sa pagitan ng mga devices. Ang mga faults na ito ay lalong kritikal sa mga kapaligiran na umaasa sa internet connectivity o network-based na serbisyo.</li></ul><p>Ang <strong>fault tolerance</strong> ay isang mahalagang konsepto sa pagiging maaasahan ng system. Tinitiyak nito na kahit may pumalyang bahagi ng isang system, ang kabuuang system ay patuloy pa ring gumagana. Sa pamamagitan ng paggamit ng mga teknik tulad ng redundancy, failover, at error recovery, ang mga fault-tolerant system ay nagbibigay ng maaasahan at tuloy-tuloy na serbisyo.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969500,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"subtopic\",\"order\":36,\"title\":\"3. Downtime\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969501,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":37,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Ang downtime ay tumutukoy sa panahon kung kailan ang isang computer system, network, o serbisyo ay hindi gumagana o hindi magagamit. Sa panahon ng downtime, hindi makaka-access ang mga gumagamit sa system, makagawa ng mga gawain, o magamit ang mga serbisyong nakadepende rito.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969502,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":38,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Sa simpleng salita, ang downtime ay nangangahulugang “hindi gumagana ang system.”</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969503,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"subtopic\",\"order\":39,\"title\":\"Mga Sanhi ng Downtime (Causes of Downtime)\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969504,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":40,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Hardware Failure</strong> – Ang pagkasira ng hardware ay isa sa mga pinakakaraniwang sanhi ng downtime. Nangyayari ito kapag humihinto sa maayos na paggana ang mga pisikal na bahagi ng computer system dahil sa pinsala, pagtanda ng kagamitan, o kondisyon ng kapaligiran.</li></ol>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969505,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"subtopic\",\"order\":41,\"title\":\"Karaniwang Sanhi ng Pagkasira ng Hardware (Common Causes of Hardware Failure)\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969506,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":42,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":{\"rows\":[[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Pagkasira ng power supply</strong></li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang sira o faulty na PSU ay maaaring biglaang magpatigil sa system</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Sobrang init ng mga bahagi (Overheating components)</strong></li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang hindi maayos na cooling ay maaaring magdulot ng sobrang init sa CPU, GPU, o motherboard</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Sira o depektibong RAM o motherboard</strong></li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang depektibong memory o circuit boards ay maaaring magdulot ng crash o hindi makapag-boot ang system</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Wear and tear</strong></li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang mga bahagi ay unti-unting nasisira sa paglipas ng panahon dahil sa tuloy-tuloy na paggamit</p>\"]],\"headers\":[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Sira na hard drives</strong></li></ul>\",\"<p>Maaaring magkaroon ng bad sectors o tuluyang pumalya ang hard disk, na nagdudulot ng pagkawala ng data</p>\"]},\"contentLayout\":\"table\"},{\"id\":1776122969507,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":43,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Mga Isyu sa Software (Software Issues)</strong> - Ang mga isyu sa software ay isa sa mga pangunahing sanhi ng downtime ng system.</li></ol><p>\\tAng software ay gumaganap bilang “utak” ng isang computer system. Kapag ito ay nagka-problema, maaaring mag-crash, mag-freeze, o huminto sa pagtugon ang buong system.</p><p><strong>Karaniwang Mga Isyu sa Software na Nagdudulot ng Downtime (Common Software Issues That Cause Downtime)</strong></p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969508,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":44,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":{\"rows\":[[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Mga Error sa Operating System</strong></li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang operating system (OS) ang namamahala sa lahat ng hardware at software resources. Kapag nagkaroon ito ng problema, naaapektuhan ang buong system.</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Corrupted Files</strong></li></ul>\",\"<p>Nangyayari ang file corruption kapag nasira o hindi mabasa ang data. Maaari nitong maapektuhan ang mga system files pati na rin ang user data.</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Failed Updates</strong></li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang mga software update ay nilalayong ayusin ang mga bugs at pahusayin ang performance, ngunit kung minsan ay maaari rin itong magdulot ng bagong problema.</p>\"]],\"headers\":[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>System Crashes o Bugs</strong></li></ul>\",\"<p>Nangyayari ang system crash kapag biglaang huminto sa paggana ang isang programa o operating system. Madalas itong sanhi ng software bugs, o mga error sa code ng programa.</p>\"]},\"contentLayout\":\"table\"},{\"id\":1776122969509,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":45,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Scheduled Maintenance (Iskedyul na Pagpapanatili) - </strong>Ang scheduled maintenance ay tumutukoy sa planadong downtime na sinasadyang isinasagawa upang mapanatiling maaasahan, ligtas, at episyente ang mga computer system. Hindi tulad ng hindi inaasahang pagkasira, ang ganitong uri ng downtime ay kontrolado at kinakailangan upang maiwasan ang mas malalaking problema sa hinaharap.</li></ol><p>Nag-iiskedyul ang mga organisasyon ng maintenance sa off-peak hours upang mabawasan ang pagkaantala sa operasyon, ngunit maaaring pansamantala pa ring hindi magamit ang system.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969510,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"subtopic\",\"order\":46,\"title\":\"Kahalagahan ng Pagiging Maaasahan ng System (Importance of System Reliability)\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969511,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"subtopic\",\"order\":47,\"title\":\"Mahalaga ang pagtiyak ng pagiging maaasahan ng system dahil\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969512,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":48,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":{\"rows\":[[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Nagpapatibay ng Tiwala ng Gumagamit (Builds User Trust)</strong></li></ul>\",\"<p>Umaasa ang mga gumagamit sa mga system na palaging gumagana nang tama</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Nakakatipid sa Gastos (Saves Cost)</strong></li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang mas kaunting pagkukumpuni at pagpapalit ng bahagi ay nagpapababa ng gastusin</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Pinoprotektahan ang Data (Protects Data)</strong></li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang mga maaasahang system ay nakakaiwas sa pagkawala o corruption ng data</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Pinapahusay ang Produktibidad (Improves Productivity)</strong></li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang matatag na system ay nagbibigay-daan sa tuloy-tuloy na trabaho nang walang pagkaantala</p>\"]],\"headers\":[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Nagpapababa ng Downtime</strong></li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang mga maaasahang system ay mas kaunti ang pagkasira at pagkaantala</p>\"]},\"contentLayout\":\"table\"},{\"id\":1776122969513,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":49,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Ang pagiging maaasahan ng system ay isang mahalagang aspeto ng computer hardware servicing. Ang isang maaasahang computer system ay nakasisiguro ng tuloy-tuloy at matatag na operasyon, na nagbibigay-daan sa mga gumagamit na maisagawa ang kanilang mga gawain nang episyente nang walang madalas na pagkaantala. Kapag maaasahan ang mga system, mas kaunti ang downtime, mas mahusay ang performance, at nababawasan ang panganib ng pagkawala ng data o pinsala sa hardware.</p><p>Sa mga totoong kapaligiran tulad ng negosyo, paaralan, at iba pang organisasyon, ang pagiging maaasahan ng system ay mahalaga upang mapanatili ang produktibidad at makapagbigay ng tuloy-tuloy na serbisyo. Kahit ang maikling panahon ng pagkasira ng system ay maaaring magdulot ng pagkaantala, pagkawala ng pera, at hindi kasiyahan ng gumagamit.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969516,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":50,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122969514,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Repair, Access, Safety\",\"Reliability, Availability, Serviceability\",\"Response, Accuracy, Speed\",\"Restore, Analyze, Support\"],\"question\":\"Ano ang ibig sabihin ng RAS sa system reliability?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969515,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Maintenance\",\"Fault tolerance\",\"Documentation\",\"Inspection\"],\"question\":\"Alin ang pinakamahusay na nagpapaliwanag ng fault tolerance?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]},{\"id\":1776122969517,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":51,\"title\":\"Paksa 5: Mga Uri ng Preventive Maintenance (Types of Preventive Maintenance)\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969518,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":52,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Ang preventive maintenance sa computer hardware servicing ay tumutukoy sa mga regular at planadong aksyon na isinasagawa upang mapanatiling maayos ang paggana ng mga computer system at maiwasan ang hindi inaasahang pagkasira. Sa halip na maghintay na mangyari ang mga problema, ang pamamaraang ito ay nakatuon sa pagpapanatili ng mga system sa mabuting kondisyon sa lahat ng oras (sumangguni sa Paksa 1).</p><p>Ang preventive maintenance ay itinuturing na isang proaktibong estratehiya, na nangangahulugang ang mga potensyal na isyu ay natutukoy at naaayos bago pa man maging seryoso at magastos na problema. Sa ganitong paraan, maiiwasan ng mga technician at gumagamit ang biglaang pagkasira ng system, pagkawala ng data, at magastos na pagkukumpuni.</p><p><strong>Pangunahing Katangian ng Preventive Maintenance (Key Characteristics of Preventive Maintenance):</strong></p><p>\\tEpektibo ang preventive maintenance dahil sa ilang mahahalagang katangian na gumagabay kung paano ito isinasagawa. Tinitiyak ng mga katangiang ito na ang mga gawain sa maintenance ay organisado, episyente, at nakatuon sa pagpigil sa pagkasira ng system.</p><ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Planado at May Iskedyul (Planned and Scheduled)</strong></li></ol><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Ang preventive maintenance ay maingat na pinaplano nang maaga at isinasagawa sa regular na pagitan tulad ng araw-araw, lingguhan, buwanan, o taun-taon. Sa halip na maghintay na masira ang kagamitan, sinusunod ng mga technician ang iskedyul ng maintenance batay sa oras, paggamit, o rekomendasyon ng manufacturer. Tinitiyak nito na lahat ng kinakailangang gawain ay natatapos sa tamang oras.</li></ul><ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Batay sa Routine (Routine-Based)</strong></li></ol><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Ang preventive maintenance ay kinapapalooban ng paulit-ulit na regular na gawain upang mapanatiling maayos ang mga system.</li></ul><p>Ang mga routine na aktibidad na ito ay simple ngunit napakahalaga kapag isinasagawa nang regular:</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969519,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":53,\"title\":\"\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970028-1.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970028-1.png\"},{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970032-2.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970032-2.png\"},{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970033-3.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970033-3.png\"},{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970047-4.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970047-4.png\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970028-1.png\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970028-1.png\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Paglilinis ng alikabok mula sa mga internal na bahagi</li></ul>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Pagsusuri ng mga cables at koneksyon</li></ul>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Updating software and drivers</li></ul>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Running antivirus scans</li></ul>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970028-1.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970028-1.png\"}],[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970032-2.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970032-2.png\"}],[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970033-3.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970033-3.png\"}],[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970047-4.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970047-4.png\"}]]},{\"id\":1776122969522,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":54,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122969520,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Corrective maintenance\",\"Preventive maintenance\",\"Emergency repair\",\"System replacement\"],\"question\":\"Aling maintenance activity ang PINAKA proactive?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969521,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Pag-install ng mga laro\",\"Regular na maintenance at monitoring\",\"Pagtaas ng liwanag ng screen\",\"Paggamit ng lumang drivers\"],\"question\":\"Aling gawain ang pinaka-nakakatulong sa pagpapabuti ng pagiging maaasahan ng system?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]},{\"id\":1776122969523,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":55,\"title\":\"Paksa 6: Hardware Preventive Maintenance\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969524,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":56,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Ang Hardware Preventive Maintenance ay tumutukoy sa regular, sistematiko, at planadong pangangalaga ng computer hardware upang matiyak na ang lahat ng bahagi ay patuloy na gumagana nang episyente at maaasahan. Sa halip na maghintay na masira ang kagamitan, ang pamamaraang ito ay nakatuon sa pagpapanatili ng mga device sa mabuting kondisyon upang maiwasan ang hindi inaasahang pagkasira.</p><p>Kasama sa gawaing ito ang iba\'t ibang aktibidad tulad ng paglilinis ng internal at external na bahagi, pagsusuri ng mga components para sa wear at pinsala, pagkukumpuni ng maliliit na problema, at pagpapalit ng mga bahagi bago pa man ito pumalya. Ang mga aktibidad na ito ay tumutulong upang mapanatili ang optimal na performance ng system at mapahaba ang lifespan ng computer.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969525,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"subtopic\",\"order\":57,\"title\":\"Mga Uri ng Hardware Preventive Maintenance\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969526,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":58,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Cleaning Maintenance (Paglilinis ng Hardware)</strong></li></ol><p>Isa sa pinakamahalagang uri ng hardware preventive maintenance. Ito ay kinapapalooban ng regular na pagtanggal ng alikabok, dumi, at kalat mula sa parehong internal at external na bahagi ng computer system upang mapanatili itong maayos ang paggana.</p><p>Sa paglipas ng panahon, natural na naiipon ang alikabok sa loob at labas ng computer. Kung hindi ito aalisin, maaaring maharang ang airflow, ma-trap ang init, at magdulot ng sobrang init o pagkasira ng mga bahagi.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969527,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":59,\"title\":\"\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970625-5.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970625-5.png\"},{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970628-6.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970628-6.png\"},{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970629-7.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970629-7.png\"},{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970635-8.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970635-8.png\"},{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970640-9.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970640-9.png\"},{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970642-10.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970642-10.png\"},{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970643-11.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970643-11.png\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970625-5.png\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970625-5.png\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Internal Cleaning (Panloob na Paglilinis)</strong></li></ul><p>Mga Video na Panoorin:</p><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><a href=\\\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OhRgBE6qgaU&amp;t=66\\\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OhRgBE6qgaU&amp;t=66</a></li><li><a href=\\\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o0I7Porz7EQ\\\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o0I7Porz7EQ</a></li><li><a href=\\\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kdURHUHztw\\\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kdURHUHztw</a></li></ul><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Fans</li></ul><p></p><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Motherboard</li></ul><p></p><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Power Supply Vents</li></ul><p></p>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>External Cleaning (Panlabas na Paglilinis)</strong></li></ul><p>Mga Video na Panoorin:</p><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><a href=\\\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gJCNAD9Ga-8\\\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gJCNAD9Ga-8</a></li><li><a href=\\\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/XRoksluU4Bk\\\">https://www.youtube.com/shorts/XRoksluU4Bk</a></li><li><a href=\\\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a1gvxsSGl-k\\\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a1gvxsSGl-k</a></li><li>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=own1U0sTQZ0</li></ul><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Keyboards</li></ul><p></p><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Monitors</li></ul><p></p><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Ports</li></ul><p></p><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>System unit casing</li></ul><p></p>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970625-5.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970625-5.png\"},{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970628-6.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970628-6.png\"},{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970629-7.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970629-7.png\"}],[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970635-8.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970635-8.png\"},{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970640-9.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970640-9.png\"},{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970642-10.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970642-10.png\"},{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/docx-lesson-6-1776122970643-11.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"docx-lesson-6-1776122970643-11.png\"}]]},{\"id\":1776122969528,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":60,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Mga Tip sa Kaligtasan (Safety Tips)</strong><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: circle;\\\"><li>Palaging patayin at i-unplug ang computer bago maglinis</li><li>Iwasang gumamit ng tubig nang direkta sa mga bahagi</li><li>Gumamit ng anti-static protection upang maiwasan ang pinsala</li><li>Mag-ingat sa paghawak ng mga panloob na bahagi</li></ul></li></ul><ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Inspection Maintenance (Pagsusuri ng Hardware)</strong></li></ol><p>\\tAng Inspection Maintenance ay isang preventive na pamamaraan na kinapapalooban ng regular na pagsusuri sa computer hardware upang matukoy ang mga palatandaan ng pinsala, wear, o posibleng pagkasira bago ito magdulot ng mas malalaking problema. Habang ang paglilinis ay nag-aalis ng dumi, tinitiyak ng inspeksyon na ang lahat ng bahagi ay maayos sa pisikal at elektrikal na aspeto.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969529,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":61,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":{\"rows\":[[\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Pagsusuri ng Mga Ports</strong></li></ol>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Suriin ang USB, HDMI, audio, at network ports para sa alikabok, corrosion, o bent pins</li><li>Subukan ang bawat port upang tiyakin ang tamang paggana</li><li>Naiiwasan ang pagkabigo ng koneksyon sa mga device</li></ul>\"],[\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Pagsusuri ng Hardware Components</strong></li></ol>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Tingnan ang bulging capacitors sa motherboard</li><li>Suriin ang hard drives at SSDs para sa kakaibang tunog o vibration</li><li>Tingnan ang mga fans para sa maayos na paggana at wear</li><li>Suriin ang power supply para sa sobrang init o kakaibang amoy</li></ul>\"],[\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Inspeksyon na Tinutulungan ng Software</strong></li></ol>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Gumamit ng diagnostic tools upang suriin ang kalusugan ng hardware (hal., hard drive S.M.A.R.T. status)</li><li>I-monitor ang temperatura at boltahe ng system</li><li>Matuklasan ang maagang palatandaan ng pagkasira na maaaring hindi makita sa pisikal na inspeksyon</li></ul>\"]],\"headers\":[\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Pagsusuri ng Mga Cables at Connectors</strong></li></ol>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Suriin ang power cords, USB cables, HDMI cables, at internal connectors</li><li>Tingnan kung may wear, bitak, o maluwag na koneksyon</li><li>Tinitiyak ang tuloy-tuloy na daloy ng kuryente at data</li></ul>\"]},\"contentLayout\":\"table\"},{\"id\":1776122969530,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":62,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Replacement Maintenance (Pagpapalit ng Bahagi)</strong></li></ol><p>\\tAng Replacement Maintenance ay isang uri ng hardware preventive maintenance na kinapapalooban ng pagpapalit ng mga worn-out, lipas na, o tumatandang bahagi bago tuluyang pumalya. Sa halip na maghintay na masira ang isang device, pinapalitan ang mga bahagi sa tamang oras upang matiyak ang tuloy-tuloy at maaasahang paggana ng system.</p><p>Ang proaktibong estratehiyang ito ay tumutulong sa pagpapanatili ng performance ng system at nakakaiwas sa hindi inaasahang pagkaantala.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969531,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"subtopic\",\"order\":63,\"title\":\"Karaniwang Pinapalitang Bahagi (Common Components Replaced)\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969532,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":64,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Hard Drives (HDD/SSD)</strong><ul data-indent-group=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"padding-left: 1.25rem; margin: 0.25rem 0 0.2rem; list-style-type: none;\\\"><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Ang mga storage device ay kabilang sa mga pinakakaraniwang pinapalitang bahagi.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Ang HDD (Hard Disk Drive) ay karaniwang tumatagal ng 3–5 taon dahil sa mga gumagalaw nitong bahagi na nasisira sa paglipas ng panahon.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Ang SSD (Solid-State Drive) ay mas tumatagal (mga 5–10 taon) ngunit unti-unti ring nasisira sa paggamit.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Cooling Fans</strong><ul data-indent-group=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"padding-left: 1.25rem; margin: 0.25rem 0 0.2rem; list-style-type: none;\\\"><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Ang mga cooling fan ay nagpapanatili ng tamang temperatura ng system.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Sa paglipas ng panahon, maaaring mag-ingay, bumagal, o huminto sa paggana ang mga ito.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Power Supply Unit (PSU)</strong><ul data-indent-group=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"padding-left: 1.25rem; margin: 0.25rem 0 0.2rem; list-style-type: none;\\\"><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Ang PSU ay nagbibigay ng kuryente sa lahat ng bahagi ng computer.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Karaniwang tumatagal ito ng mga 7–10 taon, depende sa kalidad.</li></ul></li><li><strong>RAM (Memory Modules)</strong><ul data-indent-group=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"padding-left: 1.25rem; margin: 0.25rem 0 0.2rem; list-style-type: none;\\\"><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Bihirang masira nang pisikal ang RAM, ngunit maaaring maging kulang o hindi matatag sa paglipas ng panahon.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Madalas itong pinapalitan dahil sa performance upgrade kaysa sa pagkasira.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Cables at Connectors</strong><ul data-indent-group=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"padding-left: 1.25rem; margin: 0.25rem 0 0.2rem; list-style-type: none;\\\"><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Kabilang dito ang power cables, SATA cables, at internal connectors.</li><li style=\\\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0.2rem 0;\\\">Maaari itong maging maluwag, sira, o nasisira sa paggamit.</li></ul></li></ul>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969535,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":65,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122969533,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"I-on ang system\",\"Mag-spray ng tubig\",\"I-unplug at patayin ang system\",\"Magtanggal ng software\"],\"question\":\"Ano ang unang dapat gawin ng technician bago linisin ang loob ng computer?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969534,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Mag-install ng mas maraming apps\",\"Linisin ang fans at pagbutihin ang airflow\",\"Taasan ang brightness\",\"I-disable ang antivirus\"],\"question\":\"Paano mababawasan ng technician ang overheating issues?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]},{\"id\":1776122969536,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":66,\"title\":\"Paksa 7: Software Preventive Maintenance\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969537,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":67,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Ang software preventive maintenance ay tumutukoy sa proaktibong proseso ng pagpapabuti, pag-update, at pamamahala ng mga software system upang maiwasan ang mga problema, error, o pagkasira sa hinaharap.</p><p>Hindi tulad ng corrective maintenance (na nag-aayos ng mga problema pagkatapos itong mangyari), ang preventive maintenance ay nakatuon sa pag-anticipate at pag-iwas sa mga problema bago pa ito mangyari, upang matiyak ang pangmatagalang katatagan, seguridad, at performance ng system.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969538,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"subtopic\",\"order\":68,\"title\":\"Mga Uri ng Software Preventive Maintenance (Types of Software Preventive Maintenance)\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969539,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":69,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Ang software preventive maintenance ay bahagi ng mas malawak na software maintenance, na binubuo ng apat na pangunahing uri. Ang pag-unawa sa mga ito ay makakatulong upang maipaliwanag kung paano nababagay ang preventive maintenance sa system.</p><ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Corrective Maintenance (Pag-aayos ng mga Problema)</strong></li></ol><p>Ang corrective maintenance ay tumutukoy sa proseso ng pag-aayos ng mga error, bugs, o faults sa isang system pagkatapos itong matukoy. Hindi tulad ng preventive maintenance na naglalayong maiwasan ang mga problema, ang corrective maintenance ay isinasagawa kapag may nangyari nang isyu. </p><p>Ang ganitong uri ng maintenance ay mahalaga upang maibalik ang system sa normal nitong kondisyon at masigurong patuloy itong gumagana nang maayos.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969540,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":70,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":{\"rows\":[[\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li>Error Resolution (Paglutas ng Error)</li></ol>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Pag-aayos ng system crashes, pag-freeze, o hindi inaasahang shutdown</li><li>Ibinabalik ang katatagan ng system</li></ul>\"],[\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li>Security Fixes (Pag-aayos sa Seguridad)</li></ol>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Pagtugon sa mga kahinaan (<em>vulnerabilities</em>) na maaaring maabuso</li><li>Pag-install ng mga patch upang maprotektahan ang system</li></ul>\"],[\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li>System Updates and Patches (Mga Update at Patch ng System)</li></ol>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Paglalapat ng mga update na nag-aayos ng mga kilalang isyu</li><li>Pinapabuti ang pagiging maaasahan at performance ng system</li></ul>\"]],\"headers\":[\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li>Bug Fixing (Pag-aayos ng Bugs)</li></ol>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Pagtukoy at pagwawasto ng mga error o glitches sa software</li><li>Tinitiyak na tumatakbo ang mga programa ayon sa inaasahan</li></ul>\"]},\"contentLayout\":\"table\"},{\"id\":1776122969541,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":71,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Ang corrective maintenance ay isang reaktibong uri ng maintenance na nakatuon sa pag-aayos ng mga problema pagkatapos itong mangyari. Mahalaga ang papel nito sa pagtiyak na ang mga system ay nananatiling gumagana, ligtas, at maaasahan.</p><p>Bagama’t hindi nito napipigilan ang mga isyu, mahalaga ito sa pagpapanumbalik ng operasyon at pagpapanatili ng performance ng system.</p><ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Adaptive Maintenance (Pag-aangkop ng System)</strong></li></ol><p>\\tAng adaptive maintenance ay tumutukoy sa proseso ng pagbabago at pag-update ng software upang patuloy itong gumana nang maayos sa nagbabagong kapaligiran. Ang mga pagbabagong ito ay hindi ginagawa dahil may sira ang software, kundi dahil nagbago ang kapaligiran na kinalalagyan nito.</p><p>Kabilang dito ang mga update na kinakailangan dahil sa bagong operating systems, pag-upgrade ng hardware, pagbabago sa software platforms, o mga regulasyon ng pamahalaan.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969542,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":72,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":{\"rows\":[[\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Hardware Compatibility Adjustments</strong></li></ol>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Pag-update ng software upang suportahan ang bagong processors, memory, o devices</li><li>Tinitiyak ang maayos na performance sa mga upgraded na makina</li></ul>\"],[\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Platform at Technology Changes</strong></li></ol>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Pag-aangkop ng software upang gumana sa bagong browsers, databases, o frameworks</li><li>Pinananatiling functional ang mga application sa modernong kapaligiran</li></ul>\"],[\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Regulatory at Policy Updates</strong></li></ol>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Pag-update ng system upang sumunod sa mga bagong batas o pamantayan</li><li>Tinitiyak ang legal at etikal na operasyon ng software</li></ul>\"]],\"headers\":[\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Operating System Updates</strong></li></ol>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Pagbabago ng software upang gumana sa mas bagong bersyon ng operating system</li><li>Tinitiyak ang compatibility sa mga na-update na feature ng system</li></ul>\"]},\"contentLayout\":\"table\"},{\"id\":1776122969543,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":73,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Ang <strong>adaptive maintenance</strong> ay mahalaga upang mapanatiling napapanahon ang software sa nagbabagong teknolohiya at kapaligiran. Sa pamamagitan ng paggawa ng mga kinakailangang pagbabago, natitiyak ng mga developer na ang software ay nananatiling:</p><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Tugma (Compatible)</li><li>Gumagana nang maayos (Functional)</li><li>Maaasahan (Reliable)</li></ul><ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Perfective Maintenance (Pagpapahusay ng System)</strong></li></ol><p>Ang perfective maintenance ay tumutukoy sa proseso ng pagpapahusay at pagpapabuti ng performance, usability, at functionality ng software matapos itong ma-deploy. Hindi tulad ng corrective maintenance (na nag-aayos ng mga error) o adaptive maintenance (na nagsisiguro ng compatibility), ang perfective maintenance ay nakatuon sa pagpapaganda at pagpapahusay ng system kumpara sa dati nitong kalagayan.</p><p>Kabilang dito ang pagdaragdag ng mga bagong feature, pag-optimize ng performance, at pagpapabuti ng kabuuang karanasan ng gumagamit batay sa feedback ng users at pagsusuri ng system.</p><p><strong>Pangunahing Katangian ng Perfective Maintenance (Key Characteristics of a Perfective Maintenance)</strong></p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969544,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":74,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":{\"rows\":[[\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>User-Driven (Batay sa Feedback ng Gumagamit)</strong></li></ol><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Ang ganitong uri ng maintenance ay kadalasang gabay sa feedback mula sa mga gumagamit na araw-araw na nakikipag-interact sa system.</li></ul>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Ang ganitong uri ng maintenance ay kadalasang gabay sa feedback mula sa mga gumagamit na araw-araw na nakikipag-interact sa system</li><li>Batay sa mga suhestyon, reklamo, at review</li><li>Pinaprioritize ang mga feature na talagang kailangan ng mga gumagamit</li><li>Tinutulungan na tumaas ang kasiyahan at pakikilahok ng user</li><li>Ina-align ang system sa totoong pangangailangan ng paggamit</li></ul>\"],[\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Performance-Focused (Nakatuon sa Performance)</strong></li></ol><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Layunin nitong pahusayin ang efficiency at bilis ng system.</li></ul>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Layunin nitong pahusayin ang efficiency at bilis ng system</li><li>Binabawasan ang loading time at system lag</li><li>Ina-optimize ang memory at paggamit ng resources</li><li>Pinapabuti ang response time ng applications</li><li>Pinapataas ang scalability para makayanan ang mas maraming gumagamit</li></ul>\"]],\"headers\":[\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Improvement-Oriented (Nakatuon sa Pagpapahusay)</strong></li></ol><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Pinapabuti ang kabuuang kalidad ng system kaysa sa simpleng pag-aayos ng mga error.</li></ul>\",\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Pinapabuti ang kabuuang kalidad ng system kaysa sa simpleng pag-aayos ng error</li><li>Pinapahusay ang disenyo at istruktura ng system</li><li>Pinapabuti ang umiiral na mga feature para sa mas mahusay na usability</li><li>Pinapaganda ang interface layout at navigation</li><li>Ina-optimize ang code para sa mas madaling basahin at mapanatili</li></ul>\"]},\"contentLayout\":\"table\"},{\"id\":1776122969545,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"subtopic\",\"order\":75,\"title\":\"Scheduled at Unscheduled Maintenance (Naka-iskedyul at Hindi Naka-iskedyul na Maintenance)\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969546,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":76,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Sa computer hardware servicing, ang mga aktibidad ng maintenance ay mahalaga upang matiyak na ang mga system ay tumatakbo nang maayos, mahusay, at walang abala. Sa ilalim ng software maintenance, kabilang din sa mga aktibidad na ito ang mga gawain na sumusuporta sa tamang paggana ng hardware sa pamamagitan ng mga updates, monitoring tools, at system management.</p><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Scheduled Maintenance (Naka-iskedyul na Maintenance)</strong></li></ul><p>Ang scheduled maintenance ay anumang pre-planned na gawaing maintenance na dapat tapusin ng isang partikular na tao o grupo sa loob ng itinakdang oras. Halimbawa ng scheduled maintenance ay mga gawain na nangyayari sa regular na pagitan tulad ng pagpapalit ng air filters, pagsasagawa ng oil changes, o pag-inspect ng routine. Maaari rin itong isagawa para sa mga planadong gawain na kailangan lamang gawin minsan.</p><p>Ang scheduled maintenance ay maaaring may kasamang downtime o wala. Ang ilang aktibidad tulad ng vibration monitoring ay maaaring gawin habang aktibong gumagana ang makina. Samantalang ang iba, tulad ng rewinding ng electric motor, ay nangangailangan ng buong shutdown ng kagamitan.</p><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li><strong>Unscheduled Maintenance (Hindi Naka-iskedyul na Maintenance)</strong></li></ul><p>Ang unscheduled maintenance ay isinasagawa bilang tugon sa pagkasira ng kagamitan o kapag may napansing problema na maaaring magdulot ng pagkasira. Hindi tulad ng planadong maintenance, ang unscheduled maintenance ay nangyayari nang walang paunang plano o iskedyul, at kadalasan ay nangangailangan ng agarang aksyon upang maiwasan ang karagdagang pinsala o pagkaantala sa operasyon. Bagama’t mahalaga, ang madalas na pag-asa sa unscheduled maintenance ay maaaring magpahiwatig ng mga nakatagong isyu sa planning ng maintenance o sa pagiging maaasahan ng kagamitan.</p><p>Ang maintenance—mapa-scheduled man o unscheduled—ay mahalaga upang mapanatiling tumatakbo nang maayos, ligtas, at maaasahan ang mga computer system. Ang scheduled maintenance ay tumutulong upang maiwasan ang mga problema bago pa man ito mangyari, habang ang unscheduled maintenance ay nagsisiguro ng mabilis na pag-recover kapag may isyu. Sa kabuuan, ang parehong uri ng maintenance ay nakakatulong sa pagpapahaba ng lifespan ng hardware at sa pagpapababa ng gastos.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969549,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":77,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122969547,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Para madagdagan ang RAM\",\"Para maprotektahan laban sa malware\",\"Para mapabuti ang screen resolution\",\"Para linisin ang hardware\"],\"question\":\"Ano ang layunin ng antivirus software sa maintenance?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969548,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Taasan ang brightness\",\"Mag-install ng laro\",\"Linisin ang keyboard\",\"Regular na mag-backup ng data\"],\"question\":\"Ano ang pinakamahusay na paraan upang maprotektahan ang data laban sa pagkasira ng hardware?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":3}]},{\"id\":1776122969550,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":78,\"title\":\"Paksa 8: Dokumentasyon sa Computer Servicing\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969551,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":79,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Ang dokumentasyon sa computer servicing ay tumutukoy sa sistematikong pagtatala ng lahat ng aktibidad, proseso, configuration, at maintenance na isinagawa sa mga computer system.</p><p>Ito ay nagsisilbing gabay, talaan, at reperensya para sa mga technician, na tinitiyak na ang lahat ng gawain sa servicing ay pare-pareho, masusubaybayan, at mahusay. Ang tamang dokumentasyon ay nakakatulong sa kasalukuyan at hinaharap na mga technician upang maunawaan ang kasaysayan at kalagayan ng system.</p><ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Kahalagahan ng Dokumentasyon</strong></li></ol><p>Mahalaga ang dokumentasyon sa computer hardware servicing dahil tinitiyak nito na ang lahat ng proseso, pagkukumpuni, at detalye ng system ay maayos na naitatala at madaling ma-access. Narito ang mga pangunahing dahilan kung bakit mahalaga ang dokumentasyon:</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969552,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":80,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":{\"rows\":[[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Pinapataas ang Kahusayan at Nagtitipid ng Oras</li></ul>\",\"<p>Sa tulong ng dokumentadong mga proseso at nakaraang kaso, mas mahusay na makakapagtrabaho ang mga technician sa pamamagitan ng pagsunod sa napatunayang solusyon kaysa magsimula mula sa simula. Binabawasan nito ang pagkaantala at pinapabuti ang produktibidad.</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Nagsisilbing Knowledge Base</li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang dokumentasyon ay nagsisilbing imbakan ng kaalaman, tumutulong sa mga technician na magbahagi ng impormasyon, matuto mula sa isa’t isa, at mapanatili ang mahahalagang teknikal na kasanayan sa loob ng organisasyon.</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Tumutulong sa Pagsasanay at Pagkatuto</li></ul>\",\"<p>Maaaring gamitin ng mga bagong technician ang dokumentasyon bilang gabay upang maunawaan ang mga proseso, gamit, at pamamaraan sa troubleshooting, na nagpapabilis at nagpapahusay sa pagsasanay.</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Tinitiyak ang Konsistensya at Standardisasyon</li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang mga standard na proseso na naidokumento sa mga manual o ulat ay tinitiyak na lahat ng technician ay sumusunod sa parehong pamamaraan, na nagreresulta sa pare-pareho at mataas na kalidad ng serbisyo.</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Pinapahusay ang Komunikasyon</li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang dokumentasyon ay malinaw na nagpapaliwanag ng mga problema, pagkukumpuni, at solusyon sa parehong technician at kliyente, na nagpapabuti sa pag-unawa at kasiyahan ng customer.</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Sumusuporta sa Maintenance at Plano sa Hinaharap</li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang mga talaan ng pagkukumpuni, upgrades, at configuration ng system ay tumutulong sa pagpaplano ng preventive maintenance at pagsubaybay sa performance ng hardware sa paglipas ng panahon.</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Nagbibigay ng Ebidensya at Pananagutan</li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang dokumentasyon ay nagsisilbing patunay ng nagawa na trabaho, kabilang ang pagkukumpuni, pagpapalit, at mga pagbabago. Mahalaga ito para sa pananagutan, audits, at pagsubaybay sa serbisyo.</p>\"]],\"headers\":[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Pinapabuti ang Troubleshooting at Paglutas ng Problema</li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang dokumentasyon ay nagbibigay ng talaan ng mga nakaraang isyu at solusyon, na nagpapahintulot sa mga technician na mabilis na matukoy at ayusin ang paulit-ulit na problema. Nakakaiwas ito sa pag-uulit ng parehong hakbang at nagpapabilis sa oras ng pagkukumpuni.</p>\"]},\"contentLayout\":\"table\"},{\"id\":1776122969553,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":81,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Uri ng Service Documentation</strong></li></ol><p>Ang <strong>service documentation</strong> ay tumutukoy sa mga talaan at materyales na ginagamit upang subaybayan, pamahalaan, at suportahan ang mga aktibidad sa computer hardware servicing. Bawat uri ay may partikular na layunin upang matiyak ang mahusay at organisadong pagtatrabaho.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969554,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":82,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":{\"rows\":[[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Service Report</li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang Service Report ay dokumento na inihahanda matapos matapos ang pagkukumpuni o maintenance. Nagbibigay ito ng detalyadong buod ng ginawa ng technician, kondisyon ng device pagkatapos ng serbisyo, at mahahalagang obserbasyon.</p><p>Kung ang job order ay plano, ang service report naman ang huling resulta—ipinapakita nito ang buong kwento ng serbisyong isinagawa.</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Inspection Checklist</li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang Inspection Checklist ay dokumento na ginagamit ng mga technician upang sistematikong suriin at ebalwasyon ang kondisyon ng computer hardware bago, habang, o pagkatapos ng maintenance.</p><p><br>Nagsisilbi itong gabay na may listahan ng mga item na dapat inspeksyunin upang matiyak na walang mahalagang bahagi ng system ang nakaligtaan.</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Maintenance Log</li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang Maintenance Log ay dokumento na ginagamit upang itala ang lahat ng maintenance activities na isinagawa sa isang computer system sa paglipas ng panahon. Nagbibigay ito ng kronolohikal na kasaysayan ng inspections, repairs, upgrades, at routine servicing.</p><p>Hindi tulad ng service report (na nakatuon sa isang natapos na gawain), ang maintenance log ay tuloy-tuloy—sinusubaybayan nito ang lahat ng nangyayari sa isang device sa buong lifecycle nito.</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Technical Documentation / Manuals</li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang Technical Documentation o Manuals ay detalyadong nakasulat na gabay na nagbibigay ng instruksyon, specifications, at impormasyon tungkol sa computer hardware, software, at mga sistema.<br><br>Karaniwang nililikha ito ng mga manufacturer o developer upang matulungan ang mga gumagamit at technician na maunawaan, mapatakbo, mapanatili, at ma-troubleshoot ang kagamitan nang maayos.</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Configuration Documentation</li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang Configuration Documentation ay talaan na nagdedetalye kung paano naka-configure at naka-customize ang isang computer system, network, o hardware setup para sa tamang operasyon.<br><br>Nagbibigay ito ng snapshot ng system settings, installed components, at network parameters upang matiyak ang konsistensya, reproducibility, at mas madaling troubleshooting.</p><p>Isipin ito bilang blueprint ng kung paano naka-set up ang system.</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Inventory Records</li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang Inventory Records ay mga dokumento na ginagamit upang subaybayan at pamahalaan ang lahat ng hardware components, spare parts, at consumables sa isang service o IT environment.</p><p>Tinitiyak nito na alam ng mga technician at IT staff kung ano ang available, kung ano ang kailangang punan, at kung ano ang nagamit, na nakakatulong maiwasan ang kakulangan at hindi kinakailangang pagkaantala sa maintenance o repairs.</p><p>Isipin ito bilang detalyadong log ng lahat ng kagamitan at bahagi.</p>\"],[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Incident Report</li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang Incident Report ay dokumento na ginagamit upang itala ang anumang hindi inaasahang pangyayari, aksidente, o kakaibang kaganapan habang nagseserbisyo sa computer hardware o habang ginagamit ang mga computer system.</p><p>Tinutulungan nitong subaybayan ang mga problema, security breaches, pinsala, o pagkabigo, at tinitiyak ang tamang follow-up, pananagutan, at preventive measures.</p><p>Isipin ito bilang opisyal na tala ng “ano ang nangyari, kailan, at paano ito hinarap.”</p>\"]],\"headers\":[\"<ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Job Order / Work Order</li></ul>\",\"<p>Ang Job Order (o Work Order) ay isa sa pinakamahalagang dokumento sa computer hardware servicing. Nagsisilbi itong opisyal na talaan na nagsasabi sa mga technician kung anong problema ang kailangang ayusin, sino ang gagawa ng trabaho, at kung paano isasagawa ang serbisyo.</p>\"]},\"contentLayout\":\"table\"},{\"id\":1776122969555,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":83,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Ang service documentation sa pag-aayos ng computer hardware ay kinabibilangan ng mga job order, service report, checklist, log, manual, at talaan ng imbentaryo. Ang mga dokumentong ito ay tumutulong sa mga tekniko na maging maayos sa kanilang trabaho, tiyakin ang tamang pagkakagawa ng serbisyo, at mapanatili ang maaasahang talaan ng lahat ng aktibidad sa pag-aayos.</p><ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Pagsulat ng Epektibong Ulat</strong></li></ol><p>Ang isang epektibong service report sa pag-aayos ng computer hardware ay isang malinaw, detalyado, at maayos na dokumento na nagtatala ng lahat ng nangyari sa panahon ng isang repair o maintenance task. Ito ay nagsisilbing opisyal na rekord na nagpapaliwanag ng problema, mga hakbang na ginawa, at ang pangwakas na resulta ng serbisyo.</p><p>Hindi lamang ito simpleng buod—ito ay isang propesyonal na kasangkapan sa komunikasyon na ginagamit ng mga tekniko, kliyente, at mga organisasyon upang matiyak ang transparency, pananagutan, at sanggunian para sa hinaharap.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969556,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"subtopic\",\"order\":84,\"title\":\"Mga Pangunahing Elemento ng Epektibong Ulat\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1776122969557,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":85,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Malinaw na Layunin at Saklaw</strong></li></ol><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Simulan sa layunin ng ulat:</li><li>Anong serbisyo ang isinagawa?</li><li>Anong problema o gawain ang tinugunan?</li></ul><p>Ang seksyong ito ay nagbibigay ng konteksto para sa mambabasa.</p><ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Tumpak na Pagkilala</strong></li></ol><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Pangalan at contact ng kustomer</li><li>Petsa at oras ng serbisyo</li><li>Pangalan ng tekniko</li><li>Detalye ng kagamitan (modelo / serial number)</li><li>Tinitiyak nito na malinaw kung sino at ano ang tinutukoy ng ulat.</li></ul><ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Paglalarawan ng Problema</strong></li></ol><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Ilarawan ang nakitang isyu nang eksakto at objektibo:</li><li>Ano ang hindi gumana?</li><li>Anong sintomas ang napansin?</li><li>Kailan lumitaw ang problema?</li></ul><p>Iwasan ang malabo tulad ng “hindi gumagana ang computer” — tukuyin kung ano mismo ang sira.</p><ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Diagnosis at Ginawang Trabaho</strong></li></ol><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Ipaliwanag ang mga hakbang na ginawa upang matukoy ang problema at kung paano ito naayos:</li><li>Nagsagawa ba ng testing sa mga bahagi?</li><li>Anong parte ang pinalitan?</li><li>Anong tools o software ang ginamit?</li><li>Ito ang pinaka-mahalagang bahagi ng ulat.</li></ul><ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Resulta at Kinalabasan</strong></li></ol><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Ipakita kung naresolba ang isyu at ipaliwanag ang bagong kondisyon ng kagamitan:</li><li>Ang mga tests pagkatapos ng repair ay nagpapakita ng normal na paggana</li><li>Anumang follow-up tasks o babala para sa mga gumagamit<br> Maging tapat at malinaw.</li></ul><ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Rekomendasyon</strong></li></ol><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Kung kailangan ng karagdagang aksyon, isama:</li><li>Inirerekomendang iskedyul ng maintenance</li><li>Mga parte na maaaring masira sa hinaharap</li><li>Payo upang maiwasan ang katulad na problema<br> Dagdag ito ng halaga sa ulat.</li></ul><ol style=\\\"list-style-type: decimal;\\\"><li><strong>Suportang Ebidensya</strong></li></ol><ul style=\\\"list-style-type: disc;\\\"><li>Gumamit ng visuals at appendices:</li><li>Mga larawan ng hardware bago/pagkatapos ng serbisyo</li><li>Tables ng test results</li><li>Diagrams kung kinakailangan</li><li>Ginagawa nitong mas propesyonal at kredible ang ulat.</li></ul><p>Ang pagsulat ng epektibong ulat sa pag-aayos ng computer hardware ay mahalaga upang malinaw na maitala ang mga problema, solusyon, at resulta ng teknikal na trabaho.<br> Ang isang mahusay na ulat ay naglalaman ng tumpak na detalye gaya ng isyu, diagnosis, mga hakbang na ginawa, at pangwakas na kinalabasan, na tumutulong sa mga tekniko at kliyente na maunawaan ang isinagawang serbisyo.</p><p>Dapat itong maging malinaw, maayos ang pagkakaayos, at maikli, gamit ang wastong istruktura at simpleng wika. Ang epektibong ulat ay nagpapabuti rin sa komunikasyon, sumusuporta sa mga susunod na troubleshooting, at nagsisilbing maaasahang talaan para sa maintenance at paggawa ng desisyon.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"tableData\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776122969560,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":86,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776122969558,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Job Order\",\"Service Report\",\"Maintenance Log\",\"Incident Report\"],\"question\":\"Ano ang layunin ng maintenance log?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969559,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Hindi pagtatala\",\"Random na inspeksyon\",\"Tamang dokumentasyon\",\"Software update\"],\"question\":\"Alin ang nagpapakita ng tamang dokumentasyon?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2}]},{\"id\":1776122969561,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"references\",\"order\":87,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"https://safetyculture.com/topics/preventive-maintenance\\nhttps://snapfix.com/news/corrective-maintenance-vs.-preventive-maintenance-in-hotel-operations\\nhttps://www.scribd.com/presentation/596597062/PREVENTIVE-MAINTENANCE-OF-COMPUTER-SYSTEM-AND-NETWORK-Week-8\\nhttps://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/preventive-maintenance-63450922/63450922\\nhttps://www.techbuyer.com/uk/blog/extending-lifespan-of-tech#:~:text=to%20their%20functionality.%E2%80%9D-,Find%20out%20more%20here.,working%20for%20you%20for%20longer\\nhttps://www.webopedia.com/insights/preventivemaintenancepc/\\nhttps://us.norton.com/blog/how-to/computer-maintenance\\nhttps://www.divergeit.com/blog/it-hardware-maintenance?utm_source=chatgpt.com\\nhttps://its.uiowa.edu/services/windows/best-practices-computer-owners\\nhttps://www.techtarget.com/whatis/definition/reliability#:~:text=System%20reliability%20can%20be%20achieved,1\'s%20disk%20mirroring%20provides%20redundancy\\nhttps://www.sciencedirect.com/science/chapter/edited-volume/abs/pii/B9780857092120000080\\nhttps://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/well-architected/reliability/\\nhttps://www.techtarget.com/searchdisasterrecovery/definition/fault-tolerant\\nhttps://www.sciencedirect.com/topics/computer-science/fault-tolerance\\nhttps://flowdit.com/glossary/downtime/\\nhttps://www.vpnunlimited.com/help/cybersecurity/hardware-failure?utm\\nhttps://www.numberanalytics.com/blog/system-downtime-risk-analysis-guide\\nhttps://www.womentech.net/how-to/ensuring-system-reliability-and-availability#:~:text=Role%2DSpecific%20Career%20Paths,in%20or%20register%20to%20contribute\\nhttps://giwmscdnone.gov.np/media/pdf_upload/compress-%205.%20Computer%20Hardware%2C%20Electronics%20Repair%20and%20Maintenance%20G10_mezehjf.pdf\\nhttps://www.maintainnow.app/learn/definitions/preventive-maintenance\\nhttps://theintactone.com/2019/06/17/pom-u4-topic-5-routine-and-planned-maintenance/\\nhttps://www.alamy.com/hand-of-professional-repairman-holding-a-cleaning-brush-inside-old-personal-computer-pc-cleaning-and-maintenance-concept-close-up-view-image273088046.html?imageid=F0313298-E871-4217-864E-DAFE407B6848&pn=1&searchId=3c906cc346df6366b5e2efbb4d12b67d&searchtype=0\\nhttps://www.istockphoto.com/photo/plugging-pc-cables-and-wires-gm184415451-27711778?searchscope=image%2Cfilm\\nhttps://www.pcmag.com/how-to/update-drivers-in-windows\\nhttps://support.avg.com/SupportArticleView?l=en&urlName=avg-run-antivirus-smart-scan&supportType=home\\nhttps://cdnsm5-ss6.sharpschool.com/UserFiles/Servers/Server_20856499/File/Teacher%20Pages/Lindsay%20Dolezal/IT%20Essentials/4.1.pdf\\nhttps://box.co.uk/blog/case-fan-not-spinning-fix\\nhttps://www.shutterstock.com/image-photo/cleaning-motherboard-computer-1209290149\\nhttps://www.pcsteps.com/16112-safely-remove-the-dust-computer/\\nhttps://www.forbes.com/sites/ryanwhitwam/2017/02/08/how-to-clean-your-keyboard-without-breaking-anything/\\nhttps://www.benq.com/en-ca/knowledge-center/knowledge/how-to-clean-and-disinfect-my-monitor.html\\nhttps://www.ifixit.com/Guide/How+to+Clean+the+Ports+on+your+Electronic+Device/164721\\nhttps://www.hp.com/us-en/shop/tech-takes/pc-maintenance-and-repair-tips\\nhttps://cgtechnologies.com/hardware-support/what-is-computer-hardware-maintenance/#:~:text=PC%20hardware%20maintenance%20primarily%20involves,from%20your%20keyboard%20and%20mouse\\nhttps://www.geek-aid.com/resources/articles/pc-hardware-repair.html\\nhttps://goscreenworks.com/how-often-should-you-replace-pc-parts/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\\nhttps://www.abbacustechnologies.com/what-are-the-4-types-of-software-maintenance/\\nhttps://guidelines.risa.gov.rw/books/software-support-and-maintenance-guidelines/page/types-of-software-maintenance\\nhttps://www.finoit.com/articles/software-maintenance-benefits-phases-objectives\\nhttps://automios.com/blogs/what-is-software-maintenance-and-its-types\\nhttps://limble.com/learn/scheduled-maintenance\\nhttps://www.assetwatch.com/glossary/unscheduled-maintenance?utm_source=chatgpt.com\\nhttps://www.scribd.com/document/699652125/Computer-documentation#:~:text=of%20Computer%20Documentation-,Documentation%20in%20computer%20support%20and%20maintenance%20serves%20several%20important%20purposes,for%20disasters%20or%20system%20outages\\nhttps://cdnsm5-ss6.sharpschool.com/UserFiles/Servers/Server_20856499/File/Teacher%20Pages/Lindsay%20Dolezal/IT%20Essentials/2.2.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com\\nhttps://moldstud.com/articles/p-the-importance-of-documentation-in-computer-technician-services?utm_source=chatgpt.com\\nhttps://www.atlassian.com/incident-management\\nhttps://antsroute.com/en/solutions/write-service-report\\nhttps://www.mwediting.com/how-to-write-a-technical-report\\nhttps://ca.indeed.com/career-advice/career-development/technical-report\\nhttps://buildops.com/resources/field-service-reporting\",\"fileName\":null}]', '[{\"id\":1776122969702,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Corrective Maintenance\",\"Preventive Maintenance\",\"Adaptive Maintenance\",\"Perfective Maintenance\"],\"question\":\"Anong uri ng maintenance ang nakatuon sa pag-iwas sa mga problema bago pa ito mangyari?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969703,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Pagpapalit ng sirang motherboard\",\"Paglilinis ng alikabok sa loob ng mga bahagi ng computer\",\"Pag-aayos ng sirang operating system\",\"Muling pag-install ng nasirang software\"],\"question\":\"Alin sa mga sumusunod ang bahagi ng preventive maintenance?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969704,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Para mapabilis ang internet\",\"Para maiwasan ang overheating at pagkasira ng hardware\",\"Para mapabuti ang disenyo ng software\",\"Para mabawasan ang laki ng files\"],\"question\":\"Bakit mahalaga ang kontrol sa kapaligiran (environmental control) sa maintenance ng computer?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969705,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Pagbaba ng haba ng buhay ng hardware\",\"Mas mabilis na processing\",\"Mas magandang performance\",\"Mas maayos na koneksyon\"],\"question\":\"Aling kondisyon ang nagpapataas ng panganib ng pagkasira ng hardware?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776122969706,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Software updates\",\"Pag-ipon ng alikabok\",\"Problema sa internet\",\"Error sa user interface\"],\"question\":\"Aling salik ang pinaka-nakakaambag sa pagkasira ng hardware?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969707,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Antivirus software\",\"Surge protector\",\"Disk cleaner\",\"Keyboard cover\"],\"question\":\"Ano ang pinakamainam na solusyon upang maiwasan ang pinsala dulot ng power surge?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id