 Magtanggal ng software\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969697,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Mag-install ng mas maraming apps\",\"Linisin ang fans at pagbutihin ang airflow\",\"Taasan ang brightness\",\"I-disable ang antivirus\"],\"question\":\"Ang isang PC ay madalas mag-overheat habang ginagamit. Ano ang pinakaepektibong solusyon?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969698,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Para madagdagan ang RAM\",\"Para maprotektahan laban sa malware\",\"Para mapabuti ang screen resolution\",\"Para linisin ang hardware\"],\"question\":\"Nag-install ang isang technician ng antivirus software na nag-scan ng files at nag-a-update araw-araw. Bakit ito mahalaga? Para madagdagan ang RAM Para maprotektahan laban sa malware Para mapabuti ang screen resolution Para linisin ang hardware\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969699,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Taasan ang brightness\",\"Mag-install ng laro\",\"Linisin ang keyboard\",\"Regular na mag-backup ng data\"],\"question\":\"Nais ng isang user na maiwasan ang pagkawala ng mahahalagang files kapag nasira ang hard drive. Ano ang dapat niyang gawin? Taasan ang brightness Mag-install ng laro Linisin ang keyboard Regular na mag-backup ng data\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":3},{\"id\":1776122969700,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Job Order\",\"Service Report\",\"Maintenance Log\",\"Incident Report\"],\"question\":\"Sinusuri ng isang technician ang mga nakaraang pag-aayos at upgrade na ginawa sa isang computer sa paglipas ng panahon. Anong dokumento ang kanyang ginagamit? Job Order Service Report Maintenance Log Incident Report\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969701,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Hindi pagtatala\",\"Random na inspeksyon\",\"Tamang dokumentasyon\",\"Software update\"],\"question\":\"Ang isang technician ay nagtatala ng lahat ng pag-aayos, pinalitang bahagi, at kondisyon ng system matapos ang servicing. Ano ang tawag sa gawaing ito? Hindi pagtatala Random na inspeksyon Tamang dokumentasyon Software update\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969672,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Para mapabilis ang hardware\",\"Para magkaroon ng talaan ng mga gawain ng system\",\"Para mabawasan ang paggamit ng kuryente\",\"Para mapaganda ang graphics\"],\"question\":\"Ano ang pangunahing layunin ng dokumentasyon sa computer servicing?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969673,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Cleaning maintenance\",\"Inspection maintenance\",\"Replacement maintenance\",\"Corrective maintenance\"],\"question\":\"Aling maintenance activity ang kinabibilangan ng pagsusuri sa mga kable at ports kung may sira?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969674,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Para patatagin ang boltahe at maiwasan ang pinsala\",\"Para mapabilis ang internet\",\"Para mapahusay ang performance ng software\",\"Para mabawasan ang laki ng files\"],\"question\":\"Bakit dapat ikonekta ang mga computer sa surge protector?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776122969675,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Pinapataas nito ang liwanag ng monitor\",\"Pinapabuti nito ang performance ng keyboard\",\"Pinipigilan nito ang aksidenteng pagbura ng mahahalagang files\",\"Tinatanggal nito ang virus\"],\"question\":\"Ano ang benepisyo ng maayos na pag-oorganisa ng files sa system?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969676,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Mas magandang performance\",\"Mas maayos na koneksyon\",\"Mas mabilis na processing speed\",\"Mas mataas na panganib ng pagkasira ng hardware\"],\"question\":\"Aling sitwasyon ang nagpapakita ng mahinang environmental maintenance?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":3},{\"id\":1776122969677,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Mabagal na oras ng pag-aayos\",\"Mabilis na processor\",\"Malaking storage\",\"Mataas na resolution\"],\"question\":\"Aling salik ang pinaka nakakaapekto sa system availability?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776122969678,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Gumamit ng tubig sa paglilinis\",\"Magsuot ng anti-static wrist strap\",\"Taasan ang temperatura\",\"Gumamit ng magnetic tools\"],\"question\":\"Ano ang dapat gawin upang maiwasan ang pinsala mula sa electrostatic discharge (ESD)?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969679,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Balewalain ang problema\",\"Suriin ang cooling system at airflow\",\"Mag-install ng mga laro\",\"Paulit-ulit na i-restart\"],\"question\":\"Ano ang pinakamahusay na gawin kapag may senyales ng overheating ang system?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969680,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Maintenance Log\",\"Technical Manual\",\"Job Order\",\"Incident Report\"],\"question\":\"Aling dokumento ang nagbibigay ng detalyadong tagubilin mula sa manufacturer?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969681,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Reactive maintenance\",\"Mahinang system management\",\"Epektibong preventive maintenance\",\"Emergency repair\"],\"question\":\"Aling sitwasyon ang nagpapakita ng epektibong preventive maintenance?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776122969682,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Perfective\",\"Adaptive\",\"Corrective\",\"Preventive\"],\"question\":\"Aling uri ng maintenance ang nagpapabuti sa performance at usability ng software?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776122969683,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Screen damage\",\"Posibleng problema sa system\",\"Pagkawala ng internet\",\"Pag-oorganisa ng files\"],\"question\":\"Bakit mahalagang tumugon sa mga system warnings?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969684,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Overheating at pagbawas ng efficiency\",\"Mas maayos na airflow\",\"Mas mabilis na boot time\",\"Dagdag na storage\"],\"question\":\"Ano ang posibleng resulta ng hindi regular na paglilinis ng computer fans?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776122969685,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Agad palitan ang hardware\",\"Ayusin o muling i-install ang software\",\"Linisin ang keyboard\",\"Taasan ang brightness\"],\"question\":\"Ano ang dapat gawin kung ang system ay madalas mag-crash dahil sa software issues?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776122969686,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Iwasan ang updates\",\"Regular na backup at mga hakbang sa seguridad\",\"I-disable ang antivirus\",\"Balewalain ang maintenance\"],\"question\":\"Aling gawain ang pinakamahusay na nagsisiguro ng pangmatagalang seguridad ng data?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]', '{\"hours\":0,\"minutes\":30}', 'Easy', NULL, '[]');
INSERT INTO `module` (`ModuleID`, `ModuleTitle`, `Description`, `LessonOrder`, `Tesda_Reference`, `Is_Unlocked`, `Is_Completed`, `LessonLanguage`, `Is_Deleted`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `sections`, `diagnosticQuestions`, `reviewQuestions`, `finalQuestions`, `LessonTime`, `Difficulty`, `finalInstruction`, `roadmapStages`) VALUES
(15, 'Network', '<div>This lesson focuses on the basic concepts of computer networks and how devices such as computers, phones, and printers connect to communicate and share resources like files, internet access, and printers. Basic networking emphasizes simple configurations without advanced security or performance optimization, helping build foundational skills, with tasks that include how devices connect, how data is transmitted safely, and how common network issues are identified and resolved.<sup>[1][2]</sup></div><p><br></p><p><strong>Learning Objectives:</strong></p><p>This lesson aims to:</p><ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><li>identify and describe basic network types such as PAN, LAN, MAN, and WAN, and recognize real-world examples of each;</li><li>explain common network topologies including star, bus, and ring, and describe the functions of key networking devices such as hubs, switches, and routers; and</li><li>outline the basic layers of the OSI model and explain TCP/IP fundamentals to understand how data flows across networks and support simple hands-on network setup.</li></ol>', 7, '', 0, 0, 'English', 0, '2026-04-07 19:53:20', '2026-04-27 00:17:38', '[{\"id\":1776123300092,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":1,\"title\":\"Topic 1: Introduction to Computer Networks\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1777220247068,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":2,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>A computer network is a group of linked computing devices that may communicate and share resources with one another. These devices can be found in both traditional and cloud-based settings. In order to speed up the transfer and exchange of data and resources, networking, also known as computer networking, entails connecting two or more computing devices (such as desktop computers, laptops, mobile devices, routers, and apps).[5]</p>\\n<p>In order to share information over wired or wireless connections, networked devices rely on communication protocols, which are rules that specify how to send or exchange data over a network. From personal communication and entertainment to cloud-native commercial processes and global infrastructure, computer networks are the foundation of almost every digital activity. Today\'s networks, which are built for speed, scalability, and IT security, provide dynamic data flows between virtualized cloud environments and on-premises systems.[5]</p>\\n<p>Quick Background in Computer Networking</p>\\n<p>Computer science engineers had to physically transfer computers in order to share data across devices prior to modern networking procedures. This was an exhausting procedure because computers were big and bulky at the time. In the late 1960s, the Department of Defense provided funding for the establishment of the first operational computer network, which later became known as ARPANET, in an effort to streamline the process, particularly for government employees. The internet and cloud networking, which currently offer globally distributed infrastructures and application services, were both made possible by this turning point.[5]</p>\\n<p>Computer systems and networking techniques have advanced dramatically, enabling significant inter-device communication for a variety of industries, including entertainment and business. Cloud-centric networking means using the cloud as a main place to store data and run applications. Instead of everything staying on one computer or in one building, information can move between local computers and cloud services like AWS or Microsoft Azure. This allows people to access files and programs from different places and devices more easily.Businesses can cut expenses and scale resources with this strategy. Furthermore, networking is being improved by developments in artificial intelligence and machine learning, which automate management, increase security, and optimize performance through real-time traffic monitoring.[5]</p>\\n<p>Using email as a basic example, here’s how data moves through a network. To send an email, a user must first compose the message and then click the \\\"send\\\" button. An SMTP or POP3 protocol uses the sender\'s wifi to route the message from the sender node through the network switches when the user hits \\\"send.\\\" In this case, it is compressed and divided into smaller and smaller pieces (and eventually into bits, or strings of ones and zeros).[5]</p>\\n<p>Network gateways transform data and communication protocols as necessary before sending the bit stream to the recipient\'s network. The same procedures guide the email data across the network switches on the recipient\'s network once the bit stream reaches their computer. Until the email reaches the recipient\'s inbox (the receiver node) in a human-readable format, the network reconstructs the original message during this process.[5]</p>\\n<p>What do you call a group of computers and devices connected together so they can share files, printers, and communicate with each other?</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776123300098,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":3,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776123300096,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Operating system\",\"Computer network\",\"Peripheral system\",\"Software package\"],\"question\":\"What is a computer network?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776123300097,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"To increase storage\",\"To control how data is sent and received\",\"To reduce cables\",\"To change topology\"],\"question\":\"Why are communication protocols important in a network?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1}]},{\"id\":1776123300099,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":4,\"title\":\"Topic 2: Purpose and benefits of networking in computer systems\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1777220247069,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":5,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Networking connects computers and devices so they can share data, resources, and communicate effectively. It enables everything from home internet access to global business operations by transmitting information in packets across wired or wireless links.[6][7]</p>\\n<p>Several benefits can be named in networking in computer systems. Multiple users access one printer, scanner, or storage drive, cutting hardware costs and setup needs. It’s called resource sharing. For example, an office saves money by linking all PCs to a single high-capacity server.[8][9] File and data sharing becomes easy, where you can send files instantly between devices without USB drives or duplicates, using centralized storage for updates from anywhere on the network.[6][10] There is better communication using email, video calls, and chat apps for real-time teamwork, bridging distances so remote workers collaborate like they\'re in the same room.[8][11] Cost is then reduced by buying extra devices and simplifies maintenance with shared software licenses and centralized management.[6][9] Lastly, efficiency and scalability is increased, boosting productivity by speeding up data access and grows easily—add users or devices without rebuilding everything.[8][9]</p>\\n<p>What do you call the networking benefit where multiple computers can use the same device, such as a printer, through a network?</p>\\n<p>Network security</p>\\n<p>Data encryption</p>\\n<p>Resource sharing</p>\\n<p>Network topology</p>\\n<p>How does networking improve communication?</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1776123300103,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":6,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776123300101,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Network security\",\"Data encryption\",\"Resource sharing\",\"Network topology\"],\"question\":\"What is resource sharing in networking?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776123300102,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Removes storage devices\",\"Increases cable length\",\"Allows quick data exchange between devices\",\"Changes operating systems\"],\"question\":\"How does networking improve communication?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2}]},{\"id\":1776123300104,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":7,\"title\":\"Topic 3: Types of Networks\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1777220247070,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":8,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>There are various types of computer networking options available. The classification of network in computers can be done according to their size as well as their purpose.[12]</p>\\n<p>The geographic area and number of computers that make up a network should be used to determine its size. It covers anything from gadgets kept in one room to millions of gadgets dispersed throughout the globe. The most common kinds of computer networks are as follows:[12]</p>\\n<p>Personal Area Network (PAN)</p>\\n<p>It connects devices within an individual’s immediate vicinity, typically within a range of about 10 meters (33 feet). It enables communication and data sharing among personal devices such as smartphones, tablets, laptops, smartwatches, and other wearables.[13]</p>\\n<p>Types of PANs (Not necessary to be included):</p>\\n<p>Wired PAN: Devices are connected via cables or wires in a wired PAN. Although more uncommon than wireless PANs, this kind of PAN is still useful in some situations. For instance, USB cables can be used to create a wired PAN that links devices like printers, keyboards, and external storage devices to computers, tablets, and smartphones. Reliable, fast data transport is made possible by this direct physical connection.[13]</p>\\n<p>Wireless PAN: In daily life, wireless PANs are more common. They connect devices without the need for physical cords by utilizing wireless technology. The most popular wireless technology for PANs is Bluetooth, which allows wireless data sharing and communication between nearby devices. Bluetooth PANs are perfect for connecting personal devices since they are simple to set up and provide flexibility and mobility. Depending on the particular needs and devices involved, PANs can also be created using other wireless protocols as Zigbee and Wi-Fi Direct.[13]</p>\\n<p>Advantages of PAN</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1777220247071,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":9,\"title\":\"The geographic area and number of computers that make up a n\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/219_the_geographic_area_and_number_of_comput.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"The geographic area and number of computers that make up a n\",\"fileName\":\"219_the_geographic_area_and_number_of_comput.webp\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/219_the_geographic_area_and_number_of_comput.webp\",\"fileName\":\"219_the_geographic_area_and_number_of_comput.webp\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<p><strong>The geographic area and number of computers that make up a n</strong></p><p>The geographic area and number of computers that make up a network should be…</p>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/219_the_geographic_area_and_number_of_comput.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"The geographic area and number of computers that make up a n\",\"fileName\":\"219_the_geographic_area_and_number_of_comput.webp\"}]]},{\"id\":1777220247072,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":10,\"title\":\"PAN\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/220_d_pan.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"PAN\",\"fileName\":\"220_d_pan.webp\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/220_d_pan.webp\",\"fileName\":\"220_d_pan.webp\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<p><strong>PAN</strong></p><p>d. PAN</p>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/220_d_pan.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"PAN\",\"fileName\":\"220_d_pan.webp\"}]]},{\"id\":1777220247073,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":11,\"title\":\"MAN\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/221_d_man.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"MAN\",\"fileName\":\"221_d_man.webp\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/221_d_man.webp\",\"fileName\":\"221_d_man.webp\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<p><strong>MAN</strong></p><p>d. MAN</p>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/221_d_man.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"MAN\",\"fileName\":\"221_d_man.webp\"}]]},{\"id\":1777220247074,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":12,\"title\":\"WAN\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/223_d_wan.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"WAN\",\"fileName\":\"223_d_wan.webp\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/223_d_wan.webp\",\"fileName\":\"223_d_wan.webp\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<p><strong>WAN</strong></p><p>d. WAN</p>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/223_d_wan.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"WAN\",\"fileName\":\"223_d_wan.webp\"}]]},{\"id\":1776123300160,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"review-multiple-choice\",\"order\":13,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null,\"questions\":[{\"id\":1776123300156,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"LAN\",\"WAN\",\"MAN\",\"PAN\"],\"question\":\"What type of network connects devices within a short personal range?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":3},{\"id\":1776123300157,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"PAN\",\"WAN\",\"LAN\",\"MAN\"],\"question\":\"What type of network connects devices inside a building?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776123300158,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"LAN\",\"WAN\",\"MAN\",\"PAN\"],\"question\":\"What type of network covers a city or metropolitan area?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776123300159,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"LAN\",\"MAN\",\"PAN\",\"WAN\"],\"question\":\"What type of network connects devices across countries?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":3}]},{\"id\":1776123300161,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"topic\",\"order\":14,\"title\":\"Topic 4: Network Components\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"fileName\":null},{\"id\":1777220247075,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"order\":15,\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"<p>Network components are the essential hardware and devices that enable computers and other digital equipment to communicate and share resources within a network. These components form the physical and logical foundation of data communication systems, allowing information to flow efficiently, reliably, and securely between devices. In modern networking environments, properly selected and configured network components ensure high performance, scalability, and stability.[14]</p>\\n<p>The primary network components include Hubs, Switches, Bridges Routers, Gateways, CSU/DSU, Network interface cards (NICs), ISDN adapters, Wireless access points (WAPs), Modems, Transceivers (media converters), and Firewalls. Each device plays a unique role in managing data flow, directing traffic, and connecting different segments of a network.[14]</p>\\n<p>Understanding these components is fundamental for designing, building, and maintaining efficient networks. Knowledge of how these devices function together helps network administrators optimize performance, enhance security, and troubleshoot connectivity problems. As communication technologies continue to evolve, network components remain critical in supporting business operations, education systems, cloud computing, and global digital communication.[14]</p>\\n<p>Network Components:</p>\\n<p>A hub is a basic networking device that connects multiple computers or devices in a local area network (LAN). It operates at the physical layer of the OSI model and simply broadcasts data to all connected devices without filtering or directing traffic intelligently.</p>\\n<p>A hub is used to connect multiple network devices together within a local area network (LAN). Its primary purpose is to provide a centralized connection point that enables communication between computers, printers, and other network devices. Hubs are typically used in small networks where simplicity and low cost are more important than performance and efficiency.</p>\\n<p>Hubs feature multiple Ethernet ports that allow several devices to connect simultaneously. They operate at the physical layer of the OSI model and do not perform data filtering, addressing, or traffic management. Hubs are plug-and-play devices requiring no configuration and support half-duplex communication, meaning data can only travel in one direction at a time.</p>\\n<p>The main function of a hub is to receive data from one device and transmit it to all other connected devices. It acts as a signal repeater, regenerating and strengthening signals before forwarding them to ensure data reaches all nodes within the network.</p>\",\"fileName\":null,\"contentLayout\":\"text\"},{\"id\":1777220247076,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":16,\"title\":\"Network Components\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/224_network_components_approx.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Network Components\",\"fileName\":\"224_network_components_approx.webp\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/224_network_components_approx.webp\",\"fileName\":\"224_network_components_approx.webp\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<p><strong>Network Components</strong></p>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/224_network_components_approx.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Network Components\",\"fileName\":\"224_network_components_approx.webp\"}]]},{\"id\":1777220247077,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":17,\"title\":\"Hubs feature multiple Ethernet ports that allow several devi\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/225_hubs_feature_multiple_ethernet_ports_tha.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Hubs feature multiple Ethernet ports that allow several devi\",\"fileName\":\"225_hubs_feature_multiple_ethernet_ports_tha.webp\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/225_hubs_feature_multiple_ethernet_ports_tha.webp\",\"fileName\":\"225_hubs_feature_multiple_ethernet_ports_tha.webp\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<p><strong>Hubs feature multiple Ethernet ports that allow several devi</strong></p><p>Hubs feature multiple Ethernet ports that allow several devices to connect…</p>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/225_hubs_feature_multiple_ethernet_ports_tha.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Hubs feature multiple Ethernet ports that allow several devi\",\"fileName\":\"225_hubs_feature_multiple_ethernet_ports_tha.webp\"}]]},{\"id\":1777220247078,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":18,\"title\":\"Switches\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/226_switches.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Switches\",\"fileName\":\"226_switches.webp\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lessons/226_switches.webp\",\"fileName\":\"226_switches.webp\",\"sideTexts\":[\"<p><strong>Switches</strong></p>\"],\"layerImages\":[[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/226_switches.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Switches\",\"fileName\":\"226_switches.webp\"}]]},{\"id\":1777220247079,\"file\":null,\"type\":\"image\",\"order\":19,\"title\":\"Switches identify the source and destination devices\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"/uploads/lessons/227_switches_identify_the_source_and_destina.webp\",\"file\":null,\"caption\":\"Switches identify the source and destination devices\",\"fileName\":\"227_switches_identify_the_source_and_destina.webp\"}],\"layout\":\"text-left\",\"caption\":\"\",\"content\":\"/uploads/lesso