https://th.bing.com/th/id/R.f4d738002145344d0c5291943baaab25?rik=Mv6ukxrZtsIL2Q&riu=http%3a%2f%2fwww.publicdomainpictures.net%2fpictures%2f20000%2fvelka%2fcomputer-monitor-isolated-113001152897GC.jpg&ehk=ftlPrtoYoTbSMjm9Jkz1Njji9mV6mRj16QWQUYPtYnc%3d&risl=&pid=ImgRaw&r=0\\nhttps://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/91dec10de6e77c56745005982c842614.jpg\\nhttps://static.vecteezy.com/system/resources/previews/017/351/676/original/desktop-keyboard-3d-realistic-classic-computer-keyboard-mockup-isolated-on-white-illustration-vector.jpg\\nhttps://5.imimg.com/data5/JB/IH/HH/SELLER-32247283/wired-mouse.jpg\\nhttps://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZB1f7oODL.jpg\\nhttps://www.c64-wiki.com/images/thumb/e/e3/TurboComputerLightPen.jpg/400px-TurboComputerLightPen.jpg\\nhttps://static.bhphotovideo.com/explora/sites/default/files/Kensington-Orbit-Optical-Trackball.png\\nhttps://i0.wp.com/pngimg.com/uploads/scanner/scanner_PNG11351.png\\nhttps://www.globalspec.com/ImageRepository/LearnMore/20175/Lenovo-X61-Tablet-Mode4dbcbf135820479cbd9b0730f67dd6cb.png\\nhttps://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iq76RSYbL._AC_.jpg\\nhttps://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/N2S8Jxu3dASZ3vwZgYkNHQ.jpg\\nhttps://4.bp.blogspot.com/-7IWFRCpyz_Q/Ub7_OwxZ9_I/AAAAAAAAAN0/eVVbGajHOu0/s1600/video-projector.jpg\\nhttps://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q-JroRTkS._AC_SL1500_.jpg\\nhttps://cabletimetech.com/cdn/shop/articles/01_CABLETIME_CT-AMCM5A-AG0.5_USBA_AND_CT-C160-U3-AMBM-BL1_USB_B_AND_CT-AMCMG2-AG1_USB_C_0e5cb59b-633f-45c4-a744-4b61062089cf.jpg?v=1739934504&width=800\\nhttps://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/61jA-221UVL._AC_SL1001_.jpg\\nhttps://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rnii+D8rL._AC_.jpg\\nhttps://pchome.ge/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/vga.jpg\\nhttps://cdn.prod.website-files.com/654c1a21d7927473aecf5875/65bd8b04c34a1734a4a858c2_10967-15566.png\\nhttps://img.baba-blog.com/2025/02/computer-ports-type-vector-illustration.jpg?x-oss-process=style%2Ffull\\nhttps://3.bp.blogspot.com/-9Fk5ruijV2Y/Uu3YWQNLVUI/AAAAAAAAAMs/g