\",\"options\":[\"Switching power supply\",\"Linear power supply\",\"Battery\",\"External\"],\"question\":\"Which type of power supply is MOST commonly used?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776123188477,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Keyboard\",\"Monitor\",\"CPU, GPU, power supply, motherboard\",\"Flash drive\"],\"question\":\"Which components generate heat?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776123188478,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Display\",\"Store\",\"Send data to computer\",\"Supply power\"],\"question\":\"Function of input device?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776123188479,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Convert processed data into human-readable form\",\"Enter data\",\"Store data\",\"Control system\"],\"question\":\"Function of output device?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776123188480,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Arithmetic device\",\"Core component\",\"Connected device adding functionality\",\"Software\"],\"question\":\"What is a peripheral device?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776123188481,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Keyboard\",\"Printer\",\"Monitor\",\"CPU\"],\"question\":\"Which of the following is NOT considered a peripheral device?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":3},{\"id\":1776123188482,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"HDMI\",\"Ethernet\",\"USB\",\"VGA\"],\"question\":\"Which connection type is MOST commonly used for keyboards, mice, and printers?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776123188483,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Store data permanently\",\"Process information\",\"Connect external devices and enable data transfer and communication\",\"Cool components\"],\"question\":\"What is the main function of computer ports?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776123188484,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Modem port\",\"Ethernet port\",\"FireWire port\",\"Infrared port\"],\"question\":\"Which port is primarily used to connect a computer to a local area network (LAN) or the internet?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776123188485,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Serial (COM) port\",\"Parallel port\",\"USB port\",\"Ethernet port\"],\"question\":\"Which port transmits data one bit at a time and is mostly considered a legacy port today?\",\"questionType\":\"Easy\",\"correctAnswer\":0}]', '[{\"id\":1776123188486,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Power System Unit\",\"Primary Supply Utility\",\"Power Supply Unit\",\"Processing Support Unit\"],\"question\":\"Question: A technician installs a component that distributes electrical power to all internal parts of a computer. What is this component called?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776123188487,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"SSD\",\"HDD\",\"Flash Drive\",\"Cloud Storage\"],\"question\":\"Question: A technician explains that a storage device reads and writes data using rotating disks and magnetic heads. Which device is being described?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776123188488,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"VGA\",\"USB\",\"Serial\",\"HDMI\"],\"question\":\"Question: A user connects input devices using a universal plug-and-play interface found on most modern computers. Which port is this?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776123188489,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"It stores memory\",\"It connects and allows communication between components\",\"It cools the CPU\",\"It powers peripherals\"],\"question\":\"Question: A technician explains that one component links all parts together and allows communication between them. Which function is being described?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776123188490,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Increase storage\",\"Reduce heat and prevent damage\",\"Improve internet speed\",\"Store BIOS\"],\"question\":\"Question: A computer shuts down due to overheating, so a technician installs a system to regulate temperature and protect components. What is its purpose?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776123188491,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Cheaper only\",\"More efficient and produces less heat\",\"Larger in size\",\"Uses more electricity\"],\"question\":\"Question: A technician chooses a power supply that wastes less energy and produces minimal heat during operation. Why is this type preferred?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776123188492,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"HDD\",\"SSD\",\"DVD\",\"Floppy Disk\"],\"question\":\"Question: A user upgrades storage to improve speed and reliability by choosing a device with no moving parts. Which is the best option?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776123188493,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Execute–Decode–Fetch\",\"Fetch–Decode–Execute\",\"Store–Execute–Fetch\",\"Decode–Execute–Store\"],\"question\":\"Question: A student studies how the CPU handles instructions in sequence—first retrieving, then interpreting, and finally performing them. What is the correct order?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776123188494,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"GPU\",\"Keyboard\",\"Mouse\",\"Speaker\"],\"question\":\"Question: A computer powers on, but nothing appears on the screen. The technician suspects a component responsible for visual output. Which should be checked?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776123188495,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Fan-based\",\"Liquid cooling\",\"Fanless cooling\",\"Hybrid cooling\"],\"question\":\"Question: A technician installs a silent cooling solution that does not rely on fans or pumps. Which type is this?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776123188496,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"Add fan\",\"Replace SSD with HDD\",\"Upgrade to SSD\",\"Change keyboard\"],\"question\":\"Question: A technician suggests replacing a slow storage device with one that significantly improves startup speed and system responsiveness. What is the best upgrade?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776123188497,\"skill\":\"Problem Solving\",\"options\":[\"RAM\",\"PSU\",\"Monitor\",\"GPU\"],\"question\":\"Question: A system shows no signs of power when the button is pressed. A technician begins troubleshooting the component responsible for supplying electricity. What should be checked first?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776123188498,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"SSD\",\"HDD\",\"RAM\",\"Cache\"],\"question\":\"Question: A user needs to store large amounts of data cheaply and does not require high speed. Which storage option is most suitable?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776123188499,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Stores data temporarily\",\"Requires no internet\",\"Provides remote access and backup\",\"Replaces RAM\"],\"question\":\"Question: A user accesses files from different devices and locations while keeping backups online. What advantage of storage is being used?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776123188500,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Fanless\",\"Liquid cooling\",\"No cooling\",\"VGA cooling\"],\"question\":\"Question: A gamer runs high-end applications that generate significant heat and needs an efficient cooling solution for stable performance. Which is the best choice? EXCESS ITEMS (CAN BE USED IF NEEDED)\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776123188520,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"RAM\",\"CPU\",\"Motherboard\",\"Hard Drive\"],\"question\":\"Question: A technician explains that the component responsible for executing instructions and controlling all computer operations is often called the “brain.” Which component is this?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776123188521,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Stores data permanently\",\"Stores temporary data while the computer is running\",\"Processes instructions\",\"Cools the CPU\"],\"question\":\"Question: While using multiple applications, a computer temporarily holds active data so programs can run efficiently. Which function is being described?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776123188522,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Control Unit\",\"Memory Unit\",\"Arithmetic/Logic Unit\",\"Register\"],\"question\":\"Question: During processing, a component performs calculations like addition and comparison. Which unit is responsible?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776123188523,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Cache\",\"Register\",\"Bus\",\"Clock\"],\"question\":\"The processor needs ultra-fast access to small amounts of critical data during execution. Which component handles this?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776123188524,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"RAM\",\"BIOS/UEFI\",\"PCIe slot\",\"Power supply\"],\"question\":\"Question: When a computer is powered on, firmware initializes hardware and starts the system. Which component contains this firmware?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":1},{\"id\":1776123188525,\"skill\":\"Analytical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"It consumes a large amount of power\",\"It overheats easily\",\"Data stored in it is erased when the computer is turned off\",\"It refreshes data automatically\"],\"question\":\"Question: A user loses unsaved work after a sudden shutdown. What characteristic of RAM explains this?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776123188526,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"To process and render images, videos, and graphics efficiently\",\"To store files and data\",\"To manage network connections\",\"To control input from devices like keyboard and mouse\"],\"question\":\"Question: A gamer wants smooth graphics rendering while playing high-resolution games. In order to achieve it, the user needs to have the GPU in his computer setup. What is the function of the component?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776123188527,\"skill\":\"Critical Thinking\",\"options\":[\"Stores files\",\"Processes CPU\",\"Supplies stable power\",\"Controls cooling\"],\"question\":\"Question: A new computer user sets up his computer setup for the first time. However, when he tries to turn on the computer, it won’t turn on. Turns out, he lacks the PSU component. What does the PSU’s function based on the situation?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776123188528,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Switching power supply\",\"Linear power supply\",\"Battery\",\"External\"],\"question\":\"Question: A technician selects a power supply known for high efficiency and reduced heat output. Which type is this?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":0},{\"id\":1776123188529,\"skill\":\"Technical Comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Keyboard\",\"Monitor\",\"CPU, GPU, power supply, motherboard\",\"Flash drive\"],\"question\":\"Question: A technician installs cooling systems for parts that produce heat during operation. Which are these?\",\"questionType\":\"Situational\",\"correctAnswer\":2},{\"id\":1776123188530,\"skill\":\"Memorization\",\"options\":[\"Display\",\"Store\",\"Send data to computer\",\"Supply power\"],\"qu